<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">2 Siangpahrang</book>
  <para style="h">2 Siangpahrang</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Siangpahrang</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Siangpahrang</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Siangpahrang</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel siangpahrang Ahab a thih hnuah Israel do dingin Moab mi pawl ral an tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel siangpahrang Ahaziah cu Samaria ih a siangpahrang inn diphun par zaute ihsin a tla ih besezet in a tuahmawh aw. Curuangah a nun ding le nun lo ding theih duh ah, Ekron khua ih an khawzing Baalzebub thuron dingah Filistin ram Ekron khua ahcun mi a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa ih vancungmi pakhat in Tishbe khua ih profet Elijah cu siangpahrang Ahaziah ih mi thlahmi pawl tong dingah a fial ih an hnenah, “Ziangah so Ekron khua ih Baalzebub khawzing tong dingah nan feh? Israel ramah Pathian a um lo maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nan siangpahrang hnenah, Bawipa in ‘Na nung lo ding. Na tuahmawh awknak in na thi ding,’ a lo ti, tiah va sim uh,” tiih sim dingah a fial. Bawipa ih thupekmi vekin Elijah in a tuah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />curuangah siangpahrang ih mi thlahmi pawl cu an kir. Siangpahrang in, “Ziangah nan kir?” tiah a rak sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Annih in, “Mi pakhat kan tong ih a lo thlahtu siangpahrang hnenah va kir uhla a hnenah Bawipa in, ‘Zianghrangah Ekron ih Baalzebub khawzing tong dingin mi na thlah? Israel ramah Pathian a um lo maw si? Na nung lo ding na tuahmawh awknak in na thi ding,’ tiah va sim uh, in ti ruangah kan kir a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang in, “Nan tonmi pa cu ziangvek milai so a si?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Annih in, “Savun ih tuahmi korfualpi a hruk ih savun taikhap a khap a si,” an ti. Cutikah siangpahrang in, ‘Elijah a si cu!” tiah a hun ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang in Elijah hruai dingah ralbawi pakhat le ralkap sawmnga a thlah. Elijah cu tlang parih a to laiah ralbawipa in a va hmu ih a hnenah, “Pathian ih milaipa, siangpahrang in rung seh a lo ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Elijah in, “Pathian ih milai ka si ahcun van ihsin meisa rung tla sehla nangmah le na milai pawl lo kaang thluhseh!” tiah a ti. A ti vete in van ihsin meisa a rung tla ih ralbawipa le a ralkap pawl cu an kaangthat thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siangpahrang in a dang ralbawi pakhat le ralkap sawmnga a thlah sal ih Elijah hnenah an va feh. Ralbawipa in, “Pathian ih milaipa, siangpahrang in zamrangte in rungseh a lo ti,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Elijah in, “Pathian ih milai ka si ahcun van ihsin meisa rung tla sehla nangmah le na ralkap pawl lo kaang thluhseh!” a ti. A ti vete in van ihsin Pathian ih meisa a rung tla ih ralbawipa le a ralkap pawl cu an kangthat thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siangpahrang in a dang ralbawi pakhat le ralkap sawmnga a thlah lala. Ralbawipa cu Elijah hnenah a hung feh ih Elijah hmaiah a khuk a bil ih, “Maw Pathian ih milaipa, keimah le ka milai pawl parah hin zaangfahnak nei hram awla kan nunnak cu in zuah hraam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hlanih ralbawi pahnih le an ralkap pawl cu vanih meisa in a kaangthat thluh. Asinain kei cu i zaangfah hram aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa ih vancungmi in Elijah hnenah, “Amah thawn vung feh aw. Zianghman ṭih duh hlah,” tiah a ti. Curuangah Elijah cu ralbawipa thawn siangpahrang hnenah an feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a hnenah, “ Bawipa in ‘Israel ramih Pathian um lo bangin Ekron khua Baalzebub khawzing hnenih mi na thlah ruangah tuih na ihnak ihkhun khan na tho nawn lo ding. Na thi ding a si,’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elijah hnen ih Bawipa ih ṭongkam vekin Ahaziah cu a thi. Ahaziah cu fapa a neih lo ruangah a unau Joram in, Judah siangpahrang Jehoshafat ih fapa Jehoram ih siangpahrang a ṭuan kum hnihnak ah, Israel siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siangpahrang Ahaziah ih hnaṭuanmi hmuahhmuah cu Israel Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah ngan ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Elijah cu phusiing in vancung ih a lak tikcu a thleng. Elijah le Elisha cu Gilgal in an suak ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />an feh laiah Elijah in Elisha hnenah, “Nang hitawk ah rak um aw. Kei cu Bawipa in Bethel feh dingah i fial a si,” a ti. Asinain Elisha in, “ Bawipa ih hmin saal in le nangmah ih nunnak thawn thu ka kam aw: Ka lo kirsan hrimhrim lo ding,” a ti. Curuangah an pahnih in Bethel ahcun an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutawkih a ummi profet pawl cu Elisha hnenah an ra ih, “ Bawipa in na bawipa hi tuihsun ah na hnen ihsin a lak ding, tihi na thei maw?” tiah an sut. Elisha in, “Asi, ka thei. Asinain cuih thu cu rel hlah uhsi,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Elijah in Elisha hnenah, “Nang hitawk ah rung um aw. Kei cu Bawipa in Jerikho feh dingah i fial a si,” a ti. Sikhalsehla Elisha in, “ Bawipa ih hmin saal in le na nunnak thawn thu ka kam aw: Ka lo kirsan hrimhrim lo ding,” a ti. Curuangah Jerikho ah an feh tlaang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutawkih a ummi profet pawl cu Elisha hnenah an ra ih, “ Bawipa in na bawipa hi tuihsun ah na hnen ihsin a lak ding, tihi na thei maw?” tiah an sut. Elisha in, ‘Asi, ka thei. Asinain cuih thu cu rel hlah uhsi,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Elijah in Elisha hnenah, “Nang hitawk ah rak um aw. Kei cu Bawipa in Jordan Tiva ih vung feh dingin i fial a si,” a ti. Asinain Elisha in, “ Bawipai ” hmin saal in le na nunnak thawn thu ka kam aw: Ka lo kirsan hrimhrim lo ding,” a ti. Curuangah an pahnih in an feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />profet sawmnga in Jordan Tiva tiang an vun thlun. Elijah le Elisha cu Jordan Tiva kap ahcun an ding ih profet sawmnga pawl cu a hlat nawnah an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Elijah in a korfualpi cu a hlit ih a zual hnuah cumi cun tidai cu a vuak; hmakhatte ah tidai cu a ṭhen-aw ih Elijah le Elisha cu leihul par in khatlam ral ah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutawkah Elijah in Elisha hnenah, “Kei cu na hnen ihsin lak hlo ka si thlang ding. Cutiih lak hlo ka si hlanah ziangso i tuahsak seh ti na duh?” tiah a sut. “Nangmah ai-awhtu ka sinak dingah ka covo dingih let hnih in na huham i pe aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Elijah in, “I dilmi cu lo pek dingah a harzet a si. Asinain na hnen ihsin keimah lak hlo ka si lai i hmu na si ahcun i dilmi cu na ngah ding; i hmulo a si ahcun na ngah lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu rel phah in an feh ih rinlopi ah an karlakah meisa rang pawl ih hnukmi meisa rangleng a rung thleng ih Elijah cu phusiing in van ah a zuanpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cumi cu Elisha in a hmu ih, “Ka pa, Ka pa! Rangleeng le rang ralkap bangin Israel hum theitu!” tiah a au. Cuih hnu cun Elijah cu a hmu nawn lo. A riahsia in Elisha in a hnipuan ṭhen hnih ah a thlek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hlitta mi Elijah ih korfualpi cu Elisha in a sar hnuah a kir ih Jordan Tiva kapah a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elijah ih korfualpi cun tidai cu a vuak ih, “Khuitawkah so Bawipa , Elijah ih Pathian cu a um?” tiah a ti. Tidai a vuak tikah a ṭhen-aw ih Elisha cu khatlam ralah a hei tansuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerikho ih ummi profet sawmnga in amah cu an hmuh tikah, “Elijah ih huham cu Elisha parah a um a si,” tiah an ti. An va hmuak ih a hmaiah an kun ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Micak hlir minung sawmnga hinah kan um a si. Kan feh pei ih na bawipa kan hawl pei. Bawipa ih thlarau in a cawi ih tlang parah maw, horkuam ah maw, hmunkhat khatah a taanta a si ding,” tiah an ti. Cutikah Elisha in, “Asilo, nan feh lo pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an ngen tuk ruangah a fehter hai. Minung sawmnga cu an feh ih a suk le a so ramkipah ni thum sung an hawl. Asinain Elijah cu an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Elisha in Jerikho khua in a rak hngak ih a hnenih an ra kir tikah, “Feh hlah uh ka lo ti tho lo maw?” a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerikho khawsungmi hrekkhat pawl cu Elisha hnenah an ra ih, “Bawipa, na theih vekin hi khua ih hmunram cu a ṭhazet a si. Asinain tidai a ṭha lo ih fa siatnak a suahter ringring,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Elisha in, “Kheng thar sungah cite ret uhla ka hnenah rak keng uh,” a ti. A ti vekin an rak kengih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />an khua dawhhna ah a feh ih cite cu a va paih hnuah, “ Bawipa in, ‘Hi tidai cu ka thiangfaiter zo ih thihnak le fa siatnak a suakter nawn lo ding,’ a ti a si,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih thokin Elisha ih a sim bangtuk in cuih tidai cu tidai thiangfai ah a cangta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Elisha cu Jerikho ihsin a suak ih Bethel lamih a feh laiah khua pakhat sungin mipa nauhak an rasuak ih hnihsuak sainak ah an hmang ih, “Feh aw, lu thlung kolh pa, feh aw,” tiah an auh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Elisha cu dunglam a her ih meet phah in Bawipa ih hmin in a cam hai. Cule hramlak in savom pinu pahnih an hung suak ih mipa nauhak sawmli le pahnih cu an bauhthlek thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuih sin Elisha cu Karmel Tlaangah a hung feh ih cuih hnuah Samaria ah a kir.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang Jehoshafat in an ram a uknak kum hleiriatnak ah Ahab fapa Joram cu Israel siangpahrang a cang ih Samaria khua in kum hleihnih sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah sualnak a tuah; asinain a pa le a nu Jezebel tluk lawmmam cun a sual lo. A pa ih Baal biaknak milem pawl a tuahmi cu a bal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain amah hlanih siangpahrang a ṭuantu Nebat fapa Jeroboam vekin Israel mi pawl cu sualnak lamzin ah a hruailut ih cuih sualnak cu a baansan duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab siangpahrang Mesha in tuu a zuat ih kumtinte in siah ah tuu no thawng zakhat le tuu thawng zakhat ih hmul cu Israel siangpahrang hnenah a pek ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain Israel siangpahrang Ahab a thih tikah Israel do dingin Mesha cu ral a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmakhatteah siangpahrang Joram cu Samaria in a suak ih a ralkap pawl a kokhawm ciammam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Judah siangpahrang Jehoshafat hnenah, “Moab siangpahrang cu keimah do dingin ral a tho a si. Amah do dingah i ra bawm thei pei maw?” tiah thu a cah. Cutikah siangpahrang Jehoshafat in, “Ka lo bawm ding. Keimah le ka ralkap pawl le ka rang pawl cu na duhduh ih hman ding kan si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuitawk lam in so kan nam ding?” tiah a sut. Joram in, “Edom ramih hramlak in kan feh pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah Israel siangpahrang Joram cu Judah siangpahrang le Edom siangpahrang pawl thawn an pok. Ni sarih an feh hnuah an tidai kenmi a cem. Minung hrangah siseh ṭilva hrangah siseh zianghman a um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang Joram in, “Kan cem riai a si! Moab siangpahrang ih duhduh ih tuah dingah Bawipa in kannih pathum hi in rak ruat cia a sihi!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang Jehoshafat in, “ Bawipa kan ron theinak dingah hinah profet zotal an um lo maw?” tiah a sut. Cutikah siangpahrang Joram ih ralbawi pakhat in, “Shafat fapa Elisha a um sokhaw. Amah cu Elijah rak bawmtu a si,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siangpahrang Jehoshafat in, “Elisha cu profet dik a si,” a ti. Curuangah an pathum in Elisha hnenah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Elisha in Israel siangpahrang hnenah, “Ziangah so ka hnenih na rat? Na nu le na pa ih an leen ṭheumi profet pawl kha va tong aw,” tiah a rak ti. Joram in, “Asilo; kannih siangpahrang pathum hi Moab siangpahrang ih duhduh ih tuah theinak dingah in rettu cu Bawipa a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisha in, “Ka renmi a nung Bawipa ih hmin saal in ka lo sim: Judah siangpahrang Jehoshafat ka upatnak um hlah sehla nang cu a zoh hman ka lo zoh duh lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ziangkhal va sisehla ṭingṭang tum thiam i holh aw he,” tiah a ti. Ṭingṭang tum thiam pa cun ṭingṭang cu a tum ih, culaifang ah Bawipa ih huham cu Elisha hnenah a thleng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisha in, “ Bawipa in, ‘Hi a caarmi tiva luannak ahhin khur lai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thli le ruah nan hmu lo ding naón hi tiva luannak cu tidai in a khat ding ih nanmah le nan ralkap le nan ṭilva pawl hrangah tidai tampi a um ding,’ a ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla himi cu Bawipa hrangah cun thil olte a si. Cuih hlei ah Moab mi pawl tlunah nehnak cu Bawipa in a lo pek fawn ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mawizet ih an tuahmi le ṭhazet ih an kulhmi an khawpi pawl nan lak ṭheh ding. A rahzetmi an thingkung pawl nan hau ṭheh ding. An cerhti hmuahhmuah nan caarter ṭheh ding ih, an loram ṭha hmuahhmuah khal lungto in deng tahrat in nan siatsuah ṭheh ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A thaizing, zinglam thawinak pek tikcu ah Edom lam in tidai a rung luang ih leilung cu a khuh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kanmah do dingah siangpahrang pathum an ra zo, ti kha Moab mi pawl in an theih tikah hriamnam keng theitu mipa hmuahhmuah, upabik in nauhak bik tiang, an kokhawm ṭheh ih an ramri ah ṭanhmun an khuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitih an thawh tikah ni in tidai cu a tlet ih thisen vekih sen thluh in an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Thisen a si ual! Kan ral ralkap bur thum pawl anmah le anmah an do-aw ih an that-aw thluh a si ding. Kan va feh pei ih an riahbuk kan va ram pei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuticun an feh, asinain Israel pawl ih riahbuk an thlen tikah Israel pawl in an rak nam ciamco ih an rak khir. Israel pawl cun an dawi ih Moab mi pawl cu tampi an that ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />an khua tampi an siatsuah. An fehnak ih loram ṭha hmuahhmuah parah Israel mi pakhat in lungto pakhat ciar an deng ih an loram hmuahhmuah cu lungto in a khat ṭheh. An cerhti pawl an caarter ṭheh ih, an thingthei kung pawl khal an hau ṭheh. Netabik ah an khawpi bik Kir Haresheth lawng a taang ih Israel mi lungherhden thiam pawl in an kulh ih an do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moab siangpahrang in a ralkap pawl an sung vivo ti kha a theih tikah ralnam hmang ralkap za sarih thawn a ral pawl ih an kulhnak hmun pakhat zawn in pahsuak ih Siria siangpahrang hnenah tlan a tum. Asinain a pahsuak thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Curuangah amah ai-awh ih siangpahrang cangtu ding, a fapa upabik a ko ih an khawpi kulhnak ralhruang parah Moab khawzing hnenih mei-ur thawinak hrangah a that ih a pek. Israel ralkap pawl in cumi an hmuh tikah thinphang in cuih khawpi ihsin dungah an siip ih an ramah an tlung.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Profet burpi sung ihsin profet pakhat ih nupi cu Elisha hnenah a feh ih, “Bawipa, na salpa ka pasal in i thih san. Na theih vekin amah cu Pathian duhzettu a si. Asinain atu-ah lei a baak mipa a ra ih ka fapa pahnihte leiba ai-ah sal ah kaih a tum a si,” tiah a ra ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Elisha in, “Ziang so ka lo tuah sak ding? Inn ah ziangso na neih?” tiah a sut. Anih in, “Olif siti langkhat siarlo zianghman neihmi dang ka nei lo,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elisha in, “Va feh awla na innhnen pawl hnen ihsin palang lawng tampi in va saang aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuthluh in nangmah le na fapa pahnih cu inn sungah lut uhla sangka khar uhla palang lawng sungah cun na siti palang sungih siti cu than vivo uh. An khah vete in palang pawl cu a dangah re cingcing uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah nuhmei nu cu a fapa pawl thawn inn sungah an lut ih sangka a khar hnuah, a fapa pawl ih rak kenmi palang sungah a neih cia mi siti cu a thun vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Palang hmuahhmuah khat ṭheh ko ih a thun hnuah, “Palang lawng dang a um lai maw?” tiah a sut. A fapa pakhat in, “Palang lawng dang a um nawn lo,” tiah a ti. Cutikah siti a thlet reromi cu a pit ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Profet Elisha hnenah cun a va feh sal ih, Elisha in, “Na siti zuar awla na leiba hmuahhmuah sam thluh aw. Cuih tlunah nangmah le na fapa pawl nunnak dingah paisa hlei a um hrih thotho ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nikhat ah Elisha cu Shunem khua ah a feh. Cuih khua ahcun nunau milian pakhat a um ih Elisha cu rawl ei dingah a ko ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />cuih thok ihsin Shunem khua a thlen tinte in cuih inn ah Elisha cu rawl a ei ringring. Cule a pasal hnenah, “Kan innih a ra ringring pa hi mi thianghlim a si ding tiah ka zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan inn diphun parah khaan pakhat kan tuahsak pei ih cuih khaan sungah ihkhun pakhat, cabuai pakhat, tokham pakhat le mei-inn pakhat kan retsak pei ih in ra tlawn tinin cutawkah a riak ṭheu pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nikhat cu Shunem khua ah Elisha cu a ra tlawng ih a khaan sungah cun a hung cawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule a hnen-um pa Gehazi cu, “Inntek nu va ko aw,” tiah a fial. Inntek nu a rat tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elisha in Gehazi hnenah, “Hi tluk ih in tuamhlawm ruangah le kan hrangih a zonzaih ai ah ziangso a hrangah ka tuahsak thei ding, sut hnik aw. Siangpahrang maw, ralkap hotu ralbawipa maw va ton sak in ziangthu tal va sim sak a duh maw?” tiah a ti. Inntek nu cun, “ṭulmi zianghman ka nei lo. Ka miphunpi lakah hin sammi zianghman ka nei lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Elisha in, “Cuti asile a hrangah ziangso ka tuahsak ding?” tiah Gehazi cu a sut. Gehazi in, “Sammi pakhat cu a nei: fapa a nei lo. A pasal le a tar zo fawn,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hitawk ah ra seh,” tiah Elisha in a ti. Inntek nu cu a ra ih sangka ah a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Elisha in, “Hmaikum tu tikcu ah na ṭaangah fapa te na cawi ding,” a ti. Cutikah anih in, “Aa, bawipa, nang Pathian ih minung na sisi; thuphan cu i sim hlah aw!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asinain Elisha ih a tivek in cuih hnu kum khatah fapa a hring ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hung upat deuh tikah voikhat cu fang at dingah, fang attu dang pawl thawn a pa cu lo ah a feh. An fapa te khal a pa hnenah a feh ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule rinlopi-ah, “Ka pa, ka lu a na, ka lu a na,” tiah a ai ciamco. Cutikah a pa in, “A nu hnenah vun pawk aw,” tiah a hnen-um pakhat a fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hnen-umpa in a nu hnenah cun a vun pawk ih a nu in a cawn parah sun tiang a cawi ih a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah a nu in Elisha ih khaan ah a ruak cu hun cawi in ihkhun parah a ret ih sangka a khar hnuah a taan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule a pasal a ko ih, “Hnen-um pakhat laak pakhat thawn rak thlah aw. Profet Elisha hnenah ka va feh pei ih zamrang zetin ka ra kirsal ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pasal in, “Ziangah so tuihsun kherkher ih feh cu na duh? Sabbath ni a si lo, Thla Thar Puai khal a si lo,” tiah a ti. Anih in, “A poi lo, a ṭha ko ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Laak cu a kung an dan ṭheh tikah hnen-um pa cu, “Laak hi zamrang in nawt awla ka lo sim lai hlanlo fuungter aw hlah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuticun a pok ih Elisha umnak Karmel Tlangah a feh. Shunem khua ih nunau nu a rat kha Elisha in hla nawn ah a hei hmu ih a hnen-um Gehazi hnenah, “Zohhnik, Shunem khua ih nunau nu a rat khi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zamrang in a hnenah va tlan awla, amah le a pasal le an fapa te an dam maw, va sut hnik,” tiah a ti. Gehazi hnenah cun, “Thawmvang a ṭha ko,” tiah a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asinain Elisha hnenih a thlen tikah cun a hmaiah a kun ih Elisha ih ke cu a kuah. Gehazi in tuul-hloh a tum naón Elisha in, “Tuul hlah aw. Vansang in a um tihi na hmu lo mawsi? Bawipa in a vansaannak thu i sim fawn lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah nunau nu in, “Bawipa, fapa ka lo dil dah leem mawsi? Thuphan i sim hlah aw ka lo ti lo maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Elisha in Gehazi hnenah, “Zamrang aw! Ka kianghrol hi la awla a tlan in tlan aw. Lamzin ah zohman bia-aw hlah. Mi ih an lo biak khalle bia kir hlah aw. A inn ah va feh awla a fapa ih tlunah ka kianghrol hi va thlir aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cule nunau nu in, “ Bawipa ih nunnak le nangmah ih nunnak saal in thu ka lo kam: Ka lo taan lo ding,” tiah Elisha cu a ti. Curuangah an pahnih in an feh tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gehazi cu an hmaiah a rak feh ih, an fapa te ih tlunah cun Elisha ih kianghrol cu a va thlir. Asinain ziang thawthaang hman a nei lo; cang khal a caang lo. Curuangah a kir ih Elisha hnenah, “Nauhak pa cu a nung thei cuang lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Elisha a thlen tikah amah lawng a khaan sungah a lut ih ihkhun parah nauhak pa ih ruak cu a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sangka a khar ih Bawipa hnenah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cule nauhak pa ih parah cun a bok ih a kaa zawn ah a kaa, a mit zawn ah a mit, le a kut zawn ah a kut ret in a nen. Cuticun nauhak pa ih ruak cu malte a hung hlum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cun Elisha cu a tho ih a khaan sung ahcun khatlam le khatlam ah a vak zok rero; cuih hnuah nauhak pa ih ruak cu a va nen sal. Cuti ih a tuah hnuah nauhak pa cu voi sarih a hahthio ih a mit a hun meng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cule Gehazi a ko ih, “A nu vung ko aw,” a ti. A nu cu a ra ih Elisha in, “Na fapa hi ra la aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cutikah a nu cu Elisha ih kehram ah a bok ih a hmai leilung dai in upatnak a pek. Cule a fapa te cu a cawi ih a fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Voikhat cu an ram pumpi ah paam a tlung ih cutikah Elisha cu Gilgal ah a kir. Elisha in profet pawl thu a zirh rero laiah a hnen-um pa hnenah, “Tap parah beel tumpi toh awla hi profet pawl hrangah sa-buber suang aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hnen-um pakhat cu vauhrial hawl ah hramlakah a feh. Hramlak uumhri a hmu ih uumrah a lo ih a phurh theizat in a puan in a fun. Inn ah a tlung ih ziang a si ti thei loin hramlak uum cu a sat ih sa-buber ah a suang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />An ei dingah sa-buber cu an suak ih an teh tikah, “Ai law, thihsii a si ee!” tiah an au ciamco ih an ei ngam nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cutikah Elisha in, “Sangphut malte in i pek uh,” a ti. Cumi cu beel sungah a vun thlah ih, “An ei dingah sa-buber cu suak uh,” tiah a ti. An suah sal tikah cun ei ṭha ah a cang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cun voikhat cu Baal Shalishah ihsin mi pakhat a ra ih cuih kum ih lak hmaisa bik barli sangvut ih tuahmi sang zawl kul le fangthar lak mi a vui in Elisha hrangah a rak phur. Elisha in, “Hi rawl cu profet pawl pe aw, ei hai seh,” tiah a hnen-umpa a fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Asinain a hnen-umpa in, “Minung zakhat hrangah hi cu zianghman titham a si ual lo,” a ti. Elisha in, “An ei dingah pe ko aw, ziangahtile Bawipa in, ‘An ei dingih an hlahmi tla a um ding,’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Curuangah profet pawl cu a pek hai ih an zate ih an ei hnuah, Bawipa ih ti vekin, an hlahmi a um ngaingai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Naaman cu Siria ralkap hotu ralbawipa pakhat a si ih amah thawngin Siria ralkap pawl cu Bawipa in a bawm ih an ral pawl an neh ringring. Curuangah an siangpahrang in ralbawi Naaman cu a uar zetih a upatzet fawn. Ralbawi makzet a si; asinain phaarnat a tuar ngelcel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Voikhat ah Israel mi an do laiah Siria ralkap pawl in Israel nauhak nu pakhat an kai. An hruai ih Naaman nupi ih hnen-um ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nikhat ah a bawinu hnenah, “Ka bawipa hi Samaria ih a ummi profet hnenah va feh sehla ka va duh so! A phaarnat hi a damter rori ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih thu cu Naaman in a theih tikah siangpahrang hnenah a va feh ih a va sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang in, “A ṭha, va feh awla hi ka cakuat hi Israel siangpahrang va pe phah aw,” tiah a ti. Naaman cu a feh ih ngun tangka thawng sawmthum, sui tlep thawngruk le thleng awknak hnipuan zuun hra a keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kenmi cakuat sungah cun, “Hi cakuat a lo petu hi ka ralbawi Naaman a si ih na rak theihnak dingah hi ca hi ka lo kuat. A natnak hi rak damter hram aw,” tiah a ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih cakuat cu Israel siangpahrang in a rak siar tikah mangbang in a hnipuan a thlek ṭheh ih, “Ziangtin so Siria siangpahrang in hi pa hi rak damter aw tiah i ti men? Nunnak le thihnak huham nei Pathian ah maw i ruah? Keimah thawn tawh awknak a hawl a si ko ding,” tiah awloksong in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih thu cu profet Elisha in a theih tikah siangpahrang hnenah cun, “Ziangah so riahsia in na hnipuan na thlek ṭheh? Israel ram sungah profet a um a si, ti a theihnak dingah cupa cu ka hnenah ratter aw,” tiah thu a cah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah Naaman cu a rang le a rangleng pawl thawn a feh ih Elisha innih kotka ah a va ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elisha in a hnen-um pakhat a hei thlah ih Naaman hnenah cun, “Feh awla Jordan Tiva ah voi sarih in ti va bual aw. Na titsa an cerh sal ding ih na dam ding,” tiah a va sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Naaman cu a thinheng in a kir ih, “Cu lawmmam! Ka hnenah ra in Bawipa a Pathian hnenah thla cam tahratin ka natnak hma parah a kut suangin i damter hmang ding, tiah ka ruat naón cuvek zianghman a um ual lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Damaskas ih a luangmi Abana le Pharpar tiva pawl cu Israel ramih tiva hnakin an ṭha deuh a si lo maw? Cuih tiva pawl ah ti bual ningla ka dam sawn lo ding maw?” tiah a phunzai ciamco. Cuticun thinheng in a kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah a hnen-um pawl in an hei naih ih, “Bawipa, profet in thil harsa deuh tuah dingah lo fial sehla na tuah ko ding a si. Ziangah so tiva sungih ti bual ih dam cu na duh lo?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah Naaman cu Jordan Tiva ah a vung feh ih, ti sungah cun Elisha ih ti vekin voi sarih a hnim aw ih, cuṭheh cun a dam ngaingai! A taksa cu a dam ṭheh ih naute taksa bangin a ngil lellel. Cuticun mi thiangfai ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Elisha hnenah cun a minung pawl thawn an va kir ih, “Atu cun Israel ramih Pathian siar lo leilungtlun khuitawk hmanah Pathian dang a um lo, ti ka thei zo. Curuangah Bawipa, ka lungawinak laksawng hi i saang hram aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisha in, “Ka biakmi a nung Pathian hmin saal in ka lo sim: laksawng zianghman ka la lo ding,” tiah a ti. A laksawng la dingah Naaman cun a hneek rero naón Elisha in a duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Naaman in, “Ka laksawng i co sak thei lo a si ahcun ka khua ih phurh dingah laak pahnih phur in leilung i lakter hram aw; ziangahtile atu thok ihsin Bawipa ih hnenah siar lo pathian dang zohnen hmanah raithawinak le mei-ur thawinak pawl cu ka pe nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siria khawzing Rimmon biakinn ah ka siangpahrang a feh ih ka thlun tikah anih in khawzing a biak tikah cun ka biak ve a ṭul ding ih cutik lawngah Bawipa in i ngaithiam hram seh. Bawipa cun i ngaithiam ko ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Elisha in, “Damte in va feh aw,” a ti. Cule Naaman cu a feh. Asinain malte lawng a feh man.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elisha ih hnen-um pa Gehazi in, “Ka bawipa in zianghman laksawng lak loin Naaman a fehter. Siria ralbawipa ih a pekmi cu saan ding a si naón! A nungmi Bawipa ih hmin saal in ka sim: ka dawi dingih ziangtal ka dil ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Curuangah Naaman cu a dawi. Naaman in a dunglam ih a ra tlan rero mi pakhat a hmuh tikah a rangleng par ihsin a ṭum duak ih a rak tong ih, “Thupoi a um maw?” tiah a rak sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah Gehazi in, “Thupoi zianghman a um lo. Asinain Efraim tlangpar ramih profet pawl lakin minung pahnih an ra thleng ih an hnenah ngun tangka thawngthum le hnipuan thleng awknak zuun hnih ka bawipa in pek a duh ih cumi cu nangmah in na rak pe thei pei maw ti lo sim dingah i thlah a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naaman in, “Ngun tangka thawngruk in la aw,” a ti. Ngun tangka cu dip pahnih sungah a thun sak ih la dingin a hneek. Cumi le thleng awknak hnipuan zuun hnih cu a hnen-um pahnih a phurh terih Naaman ih thupeknak bangin Gehazi ih hmaiah cun an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Elisha umnak tlang an thlen tikah Gehazi in dip pahnih cu a lak ih inn sungah a ret. Cuih hnuah Naaman ih hnen-um pahnih cu a kirter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Inn sungih a ra lut sal tikah Elisha in, “Khuiah so na feh?” tiah Gehazi cu a sut. Gehazi in, “Khuitawk hmanah ka feh hrimhrim lo,” tiah a pheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Elisha cun, “Naaman cu a rangleng in a ṭum ih a lo ton laiah khan ka thlarau in na hnenih tel ve lo ah maw si i ruah? Atuih caan hi paisa le hnipuan, olif hmuan le sabit hmuan, tuu le caw, salnu le salpa, laak caan a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asinain Naaman ih nat in a lo kai ding ih nangmah le na tesinfa pawl cu cuih natnak a kumkhua in nan nei ta ding a si,” tiah a ti. Gehazi cu lengah a suak ih cuih nat cu a tuar ngaingai - a vun cu vur bangin a rang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Voikhat ah Elisha ih ho mi profet pawl cu Elisha hnenah an ra ih, “Zohhnik aw, kan umnak hi a fate tuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan umnak inn a tum deuh ih sak dingah thing hau dingin Jordan ah in fehter aw,” tiah an ti. Elisha in, “A ṭha, feh uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule profet pakhat in feh ve dingah Elisha cu a sawm ih a lung a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule an zatein an feh tlang. Jordan an thlen tikah thing cu an hau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pakhat pa in thing a hau laiah rinlopi-in ti sungah a hrei fang a tla pang. “Ailaw, ka bawipa, ziangtinso ka tuah ding? Ka saan mi a si fawn,” tiah a au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Elisha in, “Khuitawk zawn ah so a tlak?” tiah a sut. Cupa cun a tlaknak zawn cu a sim. Cutikah Elisha in funghreu pakhat a saat ih tidai sungah a vun hlon ih hrei fang cu a hung phuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elisha in, “Vun la aw,” a ti ih cupa cun a vun dawh ih a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Voikhat ah Siria siangpahrang in Israel ram a do. A ralbawi pawl thawn an tongkhawm aw ih, “Cutawk zawn, khatawk zawn in nan nam pei?” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Elisha in Israel siangpahrang hnenah, “Cutawk, khatawk ahcun feh hlah uh. Siria ralkap pawl in an lo bawh a si,” tin thu a cah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah Israel siangpahrang in cutawk lamih a fehmi ralkap pawl cu ralrinnak a pek ih ralring zetin an um. Cuticun voi tampi an luat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cumi cu Siria siangpahrang in a theih tikah a thin a heng ngaingai. A ralbawi pawl a ko ih, “Zoso Israel siangpahrang lamah a ṭangtu kan lakah a um?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah a ralbawi pakhat in, “Maw siangpahrang, zohman in kan lo zuar lo. Na khaan sungih na relmi na thuthup hman kha profet Elisha in Israel siangpahrang hnenih a sim cingcing ruangah a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siria siangpahrang in, “Cupa ih umnak cu i sim uhla ka kai ding,” tiah a ti. Elisha cu Dothan ah a um, ti ih an sim tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />rang le rangleng pawl thawn ralkap tampi cutawkah a hei thlah. Dothan khua cu zanah an va thleng ih an kulh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thaizing zingthlapit ih Elisha ih hnen-um pa a thawh tikah inn lengah a va suak ih, Dothan khua kulhtu Siria ralkap pawl, an rang le rangleng pawl thawn an tiar awk ṭhepṭhep kha a hmu. Elisha hnenah a vung tlan ih, “Ailaw, bawipa, kan cem a si! Ziangtin so kan um ding?” tiah thinphang in a au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Elisha in, “Na thinphang hlah; annih hnenih a ummi hnakin kannih hnenih a ummi an tam sawn,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ih hnenah thla a cam. “Maw Bawipa , a mit run vaangter awla khua run hmuhter aw,” a ti. Bawipa in a thlacamnak cu a run thei ih Elisha ih hnen-um pa cun khua a hun thlir tikah Elisha ih kiangkap tlangtluan hmuahhmuah cu rang le meisa rangleng in an khah ṭhepṭhep kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siria ralkap pawl in an run nam tikah Elisha in thla a cam ih, “Maw Bawipa , hi ralkap pawl hi an mit run cawter aw,” a ti. Bawipa in a thlacamnak cu a run thei ih an mit a cawtter ṭheh ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule Elisha cu an hnenah a va feh ih, “Nan lamzin nan hlo a si. Nan hawl reromi khua cu himi a si lo. I thlun uhla nan hawl mipa umnak ah ka lo hruai hai ding,” tiah a ti. Cuticun Samaria ah a hruai hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khua sungih an thlen vete in Elisha in thla a cam ih, “Maw Bawipa , an mit run damter awla khua hmu hai seh,” a ti. Bawipa in a thlacamnak cu a run thei; an mit a run damter ih Samaria khua sungih an um kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel siangpahrang in Siria ralkap pawl a hmuh tikah, “Bawipa, hi ralkap pawl hi ka that thluh pei maw?” tiah Elisha a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah Elisha in, “Na that lo pei. Ral nan donak ih nan kaihmi ralkap pawl hman nan that lo pei. An ei ding ti le rawl pe hai uhla an siangpahrang hnenah tlung hai seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah Israel siangpahrang in anmah ih hrangah rawl ei puai tumzet a tuahsak ih an in an ei ṭheh hnuah Siria siangpahrang hnenah an tlung. Cuih ṭum thokin Siria ralkap pawl in Israel ram an rung do nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tikcu a hung rei deuh tikah Siria siangpahrang Benhadad in a ralkap hmuahhmuah a kokhawm ih Israel a do ih Samaria khawpi cu a kulh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutiih caan reipi a kulh ṭheh ruangah cun Samaria khua sungah rawl a har ciammam ih laak lu pakhat cu ngun tangka sawmriat a man ih tlangpurun mehtok kilh khatah ngun tangka fangnga a man.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nikhat ah Israel siangpahrang cu khawpi kulhnak lungdawl kapih lam a leen laiah nunau nu pakhat in, “Maw siangpahrang Bawipa, i bawm hram aw,” tiah a auh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siangpahrang Bawipa in, “ Bawipa Pathian in a lo bawm lo a si ahcun kei in ziangso ka lo bawm thei ding? Sangvut le sabit nei ah maw si i ruah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ziang so na poi?” tiah a ti. Nunau nu in, “Kan dungah hi nunau nu hin, ‘Na faate kan ei pei ih, thaisun ah kei ih faate kan ei leh pei,’ tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Curuangah ka faate cu kan suang ih kan ei thluh. A thaisun ah na faate kan ei thlang pei, ka ti naón a thuphlo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih thu cu siangpahrang in a theih tikah a riahsia in a hnipuan a thlek ṭheh. Khawpi kulhnak lungdawl parih a feh laiah a kiangkap ih a ummi pawl in a hnipuan hnuai ah buri a hruh kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang bawipa cun, “Tuihsun rori ih Shafat fapa Elisha a hngawng ka tan lo a si ahcun Bawipa in keimah i that seh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cule Elisha kai dingin mi a thlah. Culai ah Elisha cu a inn ah a rak um ih upa hrekkhat pawl in an rak leeng. Siangpahrang ih thlahmi milai a ra thlen hlan deuh ah Elisha in, “Khi laithat pa in keimah that dingah mi pakhat a rak thlah a si,” tiah upa pawl cu a sim. “A thlah mipa a ra thlen tikah sangka khar uhla inn sungah lutter hlah uh. Siangpahrang amah khal a ra thleng cing ve ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cutiih a ṭong hman a cem hlanah siangpahrang cu a ra thleng ngaingai ih anih in, “Hi bangtuk harsatnak kan parih a thlengtertu hi Bawipa a si. Ziangtin so amah ih bomnak cu ka rin thei nawn ding?” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cutikah Elisha in, “ Bawipa ih thusimmi hi ngai uh! Thaisun atu tikcu ah Samaria khua ih dawr ahhin sangvut ṭha bik cuai khat, a si lole barli sangvut cuai hnih cu ngun tangka fangkhat in nan lei thei ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siangpahrang thluntu bawi pakhat in Elisha hnenah, “Thil cang thei a si lo- Bawipa amah in van tukvirh ong in fang run thla ciamco hmansehla a cang thei zik lo!” tiah a sawn. Cule Elisha in, “A cang dingih na mit rori in na hmu ding; asinain nang cun na ei ngah lo ding,” tiah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Phaarnat a tuartu mina pali cu khawpi kotka ah an um ih pakhat le pakhat hnenah, “Ziangah so kan thih thlak tiang hitawk ih kan um duh rero ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawsungih kan vungluh khalle a ṭhahnem lo, rawl loin kan thi ko ding; hitawk ih kan um khalle kan thi thotho ding. Curuangah Siria ralkap pawl ih riah hmunah kan va feh sawn pei. In thah asile kan va thi ko pei; asinain that loin in zuah khal a si thei men sokhaw,” tiah an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah khua a thim zawng ah Siria ralkap pawl riahhmun ahcun an va feh. Asinain an va thlen ngaingai tikah pakhat hman an rak um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in Siria ralkap pawl ih hnathlam sungah thawmvang a thanter ih cuih thawmvang cu ralkap tam ngaingai, rang le rangleng tampi thawmvang vek a si. Israel siangpahrang in Hit siangpahrang le Izipt siangpahrang, an ralkap pawl thawn a sawm ih in ra do tum a sihi, tiah Siria ralkap pawl cun an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah thih ṭih ah Siria ralkap pawl cu lusam hman mang loin an tlan ih, an puanthlam, an rang le an laak pawl khal cuh man loin an riahhmun cu amah keel in an taan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Miphar pali cu riahhmun an thlen tikah puanthlam pakhat sungah an lut ih puanthlam sungih ummi rawl cu an ei an in hnuah an tonmi sui, ngun le hnipuan pawl cu zamrang in an cuh ih anmah ih hrangah an thup. An rakir ih puanthlam a dang pakhat sungah an lut ih cuti thotho in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah anmah le anmah, “Hitiih kan tuahmi hi thildik a si lo. Thuthang ṭha kan nei a si ih kanmah ih hrang lawngah siseh ti ding a si lo. Thaizing tiang kan hngah asile mawh kan phur tengteng ding. Atu rori ah kan feh pei ih siangpahrang kuthnuai ih bawi pawl kan va sim pei,” tiah an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah Siria ralkap pawl ih riahhmun cun an suak ih Samaria khawsungah an lut ih kotka kiltu pawl hnenah, “Siria ralkap pawl ih riah hmunah kan va feh ih zohman kan hmu lo, a ṭhing. An rang le an laak pawl hri hman an suut ta lo! An puanthlam pawl khal Siria ralkap pawl ih an tlansan vek rori in an um lai a si,” tiah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih thu cu kotka kiltu pawl in siangpahrang hnenah an vung sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zan asinain siangpahrang bawipa cu a tho ih a kuthnuai bawi pawl hnenah, “Siria ralkap pawl ih tummi ka lo sim ding. Khawsungih rawl a um lo hi an thei. Curuangah an riahhmun ihsin an suak ih hramlakah an thup-aw a si. Rawl hawl ah khawsung ihsin an rasuak ding ih cutikah a nungin kan kai ṭheh dingih an khawpi khal kan la suak ding a si, tiah an ruat a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah a kuthnuai ih bawi pakhat in, “Ziang a sihmanah kan hlanih a thi zomi pawl vekin hi khawsungih a ummi hmuahhmuah cu kan thi thluh thotho ding a si. Curuangah thil umdaan ziangvek ngaingai so a si, ti kan theihnak dingah a nung hrihmi rang panga thawn mi hrekkhat kan hei thlah hnik pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah milai hrekkhat an hril ih Siria ralkap pawl khui ah an si, ti zoh dingah siangpahrang in rangleng pahnih in a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An feh ih Jordan an thleng. Lamzin tluanah Siria ralkap pawl in an tlan phah ih an thlaumi an hnipuan le an hriamnam pawl an hmu. An ra kir ih cuih thu cu siangpahrang an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Samaria khawsungmi mi burpi pawl cu pah that-aw thluh zik in an ra suak ih Siria ralkap pawl ih riahhmun cu an va ram ciamco. Cule Bawipa ih ṭongmi vek cekci in sangvut ṭha bik cuai khat, a si lole barli sangvut cuai hnih ah ngun tangka fangkhat in an zuar ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih ṭum ngelcel ah Israel siangpahrang in amah a rak thlun ṭheutu a kuthnuai ih bawi cu kotka kiltu pawl hotu ah a ret. Cule misenpi pawl Siria ralkap riahhmun lamih an nor awk ciamco tikah cuih hotu pa cu an pal that; Elisha tong dingin siangpahrang a feh ṭum ih Elisha ih ṭong vekin cupa cu a thi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Elisha in siangpahrang hnenah, “Thaisun tu tikcu ah Samaria khua ih dawr ahhin sangvut ṭha bik cuai khat, a si lole barli sangvut cuai hnih cu ngun tangka fangkhat in an zuar ding,” a rak ti tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />cuih siangpahrang thluntu bawi cun, “A cang thei mi a si lo- Bawipa amah in hmakhatte-ah van tukvirh ong in fang run thla ciamco hmansehla a cang thei zik lo,” tiah a rak sawn. Cule Elisha cun, “A cang dingih na mit rori in na hmu ding; asinain nang cun na ei ngah lo ding,” tiah a rak let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ti vekin a parah a thleng ngaingai; misenpi in khawpi kotka ah an pal that a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shunem khua ih um, a fapa a nunter sal mi nunau hnenah, “Tho awla Bawipa in a zonzon in kum sarih sung paam a tlunter ding ruangah, nangmah le na innsang pawl thawn hmun dangah feh in nan um le a ṭha ding” tiah Elisha in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thusimmi cu ngai in a innsang pawl thawn Filistin ram ah an feh ih cutawkah kum sarih sung an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sarih hnuah cuih nunau nu cu Israel ramah a ra kir sal ih a inn le a lo pawl ngah thei sal dingah siangpahrang dil ding a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Culai ah siangpahrang cu Elisha hnen-um pa Gehazi thawn thu an rak ruah aw rero. Elisha ih mangbangza tuahmi pawl cu siangpahrang in theih a duhzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Elisha in nauhak pa a nunter salnak thu cu Gehazi in siangpahrang a sim rero laiah Shunem nunau nu cun siangpahrang hnenih a ngenmi thu cu a hun sim. Cutikah Gehazi in, “Maw siangpahrang bawipa, ka lo simmi nunau nu le Elisha ih a nunter salmi a fapa te cu hinah an ra,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siangpahrang in thu a suh vivo tikah Gehazi ih simmi cu thudik a si kha a thei vivo. Cule siangpahrang in a kuthnuai ih bawi pakhat a ko ih cuih nunau nu hnenah a hlanih a ta a rak si mi hmuahhmuah le a um lo kum sarih sung a lo sung suak rawl man hmuahhmuah tla pe thluh dingin thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Voikhat ah Elisha cu Damaskas khua-ah a feh. Culai ah Siria siangpahrang Benhadad cu a rak na ngelcel. Elisha cu Damaskas khua sungah a um, ti kha siangpahrang in a theih tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a kuthnuai bawi pakhat Hazael a ko ih, “Profet cu laksawng va pe awla ka nung ding maw, nung lo ding Bawipa i sut sak hram seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah Hazael cun Damaskas in a suakmi thilri a ṭha bik pawl a phunkim in a lak ih kalauk sawmli a phurhter ih Elisha hnenah cun a feh. Hazael in Elisha a ton tikah, “Na siahhlawh Siria siangpahrang Benhadad in a natnak in a dam ding maw, dam lo ding ti lo sut dingah i thlah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Elisha in, “Nan siangpahrang bawipa cu a thi ding, tiah Bawipa in ka hnenah a phuang zo a si; asinain va feh awla na nung ding, tiah va sim aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Elisha cun a mithmai sia in Hazael a meet ringring ih Hazael cu a um a nuam lo ih a hmai tiangin a sen ṭheh. Cun Elisha cu rinlopi in a ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Hazael in, “Bawipa, ziangah so na ṭah?” tiah a sut. Elisha in, “Israel mi parih thil siava na tuah dingmi hi ka hmuh ruangah ka ṭap a si. An ralhruang na ur ṭheh ding, an tlangval pawl ralnam in na cihmit thluh ding, an faate pawl leilung ah na vua that thluh ding ih nau keng nunau pawl na zaithlek thluh hai ding a si,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Hazael cun, “Ziangtin so cutiih tuah theinak huham ka neih ding? Kei cu uico tluk fang ka sisi; zianghman ka si ual lo,” a ti. Elisha cun, “ Bawipa in i hmuh zo ih Siria ram siangpahrang na si ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hazael cu a kir ih Benhadad cun, “Elisha in ziang a lo ti so?” tiah a rak sut. Cutikah Hazael in, “A nung ding, a lo ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain a thaisun ah Hazael in puan sahzet pakhat a lak ih tidai sungah a ciah hnuah siangpahrang ih hmai a tuam ih siangpahrang cu a that. Cuticun Hazael cu Siria siangpahrang ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahab fapa Joram cu Israel siangpahrang a sinak kum, kum nganak ah Jehoshafat ih fapa Jehoram cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang ṭuan a thok. Siangpahrang a si tikah kum sawmthum le kum hnih a si ih Jerusalem khua in kum riat sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A nupi cu Ahab ih fanu a si ih Ahab innsung saang vekin Jehoram khal cun Israel siangpahrang pawl ih tuahmi thil ṭha lo a thlun ve. Bawipa ih parah sualnak a tuah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />asinain Judah ram cu Bawipa in a siatsuah siang lo, ziangahtile a salpa David hnenah a tefa pawl in ram an uk ringring ding, ti ih thu a rak kam zo ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jehoram siangpahrang a si laiah Judah do dingin Edom mi pawl ral an tho ih anmahte uk awknak an ngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah Jehoram cu a rangleng pawl thawn Zair ah a feh ih cutawkah Edom ralkap pawl in an kulh ṭheh. Zanṭim ah Jehoram le a rangleng mawng hotu pawl cun anmah kulhtu Edom ralkap pawl cu an pahsuak ih an luat; an ralkap pawl cu an inn ciarah an tlan ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih thokin Edom cu Judah ram thawn peh-aw nawn loin mahte uk awknak a ngahta. Cuih ṭum thotho ah Libnah khawpi tla ral an tho a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehoram ih hnaṭuan mi dangdang pawl cu Judah Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu timi sungah an ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule Jehoram cu a thi ih Jerusalem David khawpi, siangpahrang thlaan ah an phum. Cuih hnuah a fapa Ahaziah in a ai ah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahab ih fapa Joram in Israel siangpahrang a ṭuan ih kum hleihnihnak ah Jehoram ih fapa Ahaziah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan thok. Siangpahrang a ṭuan tikah amah cu kum kul hluanhnih a si. A ram cu Jerusalem in kum khat a uk. A nu Athaliah cu Israel siangpahrang Omri ih tunu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahaziah cu ṭhit awknak in siangpahrang Ahab thawn an peh awk ruangah Ahab innsang vek thotho in Bawipa ih parah sualnak a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siangpahrang Ahaziah in Israel siangpahrang Joram a ṭanpi ih Siria siangpahrang Hazael cu an do. Gilead ram Ramoth ah an tawng-aw ih Joram cu hriamhma a pu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Curuangah Jezreel khawpi ah dam duh ah a kir sal. Cutawkah Judah siangpahrang Ahaziah cun a vung veh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Culai ah profet Elisha in profet pawl lakih mino pakhat a ko ih, “Na timtuah awla Gilead ram Ramoth ah va feh aw. Hi olif hriak thawl hi pai awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />cutawk na thlen tikah Nimshi ih tupa Jehu, Jehoshafat ih fapa va hawl aw. A rualpi pawl um lonak khaan pakhat ah ko awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />hi olif siti hi a lu ah toih in, ‘Israel siangpahrang dingah Bawipa in hriak a lo culh a si,’ ti aw. Cule zamrangte in ra tlan aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuticun tlangval no profet pakhat cu Ramoth ahcun a feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />bawi pawl an tonkhawm awk laifang a va tong. Cutikah profet in, “Bawipa ka lo tongta duh a si,” a ti. Jehu cun, “Zo sawn so in biak?” a ti. Cutikah profet cun, “Bawipa nangmah,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule an pahnih cun inn sungah an lut ih profet in olif hriak cu Jehu lu ah a toih ih, “ Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in ‘Ka miphun Israel mi siangpahrang ah hriak ka lo culh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka profet pawl le ka hnaṭuantu pawl Jezebel in a thah ruangah amah ka hrem theinak dingah Ahab fapa, siangpahrang na bawipa cu na that pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahab innsang le a tesinfa pawl cu an thih a ṭul a si; a no siseh, a tar siseh, a innsang ih mipa hmuahhmuah ka cihmit thluh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nebat fapa siangpahrang Jeroboam innsang le Ahijah fapa siangpahrang Baasha innsang parih thil ka tuah vekin Ahab innsang par khalah ka tuah ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jezebel cu zohman in an phum lo ding; a ruak cu Jezreel ramah uico in an ei ding,’ a ti,” tiah a sim. Cumi a sim ṭheh vete in profet mino pa cu a suak ih a tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jehu cu a rualpi bawi pawl hnenah cun a va kir. Annih in, “Ziang thuhla so a um? Kha mi-aa pa cun ziangah so a lo ton duh?” tiah an sut. Jehu cun, “Ziangvek minung a si ti le ziang a duh ti cu nan thei ko a si lo maw?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Annih in, “Asilo, kan thei lo ngaingai sokhaw. A lo timi cu in sim hnik aw,” tiah an ti. Cutikah Jehu cun, “ Bawipa in ‘Israel siangpahrang ah hriak ka lo culh,’ a lo ti, i ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuvete in a rualpi bawi pawl cun an korfual pawl an hliit ih Jehu dinnak dingah kailawn tlunta bik ah an phah ih tawtawrawt an tum hnuah, “Jehu cu siangpahrang a si,” tiah an aw neih patawp suah in an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun Jehu in siangpahrang Joram cu a phiar. Siangpahrang Joram cu Siria siangpahrang Hazael a do ih Ramoth ah hriamhma a pu ih a hma dam tum in Jezreel ah a fehnak ihsin khui hmanah a suak hrih lo. Jehu in a rualpi bawi pawl hnenah cun, “Ka lam ṭangtu nan si ahcun Jezreel khuami pawl va sim ding ah zohman Ramoth khawpi ihsin nan suak lo pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule a rangleng parah a to ih Jezreel lamah cun a suak. Joram cu a dam ngah hrih lo ih Judah siangpahrang Ahaziah in a rak veh laifang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jezreel khua kotka kiltu in Jehu le a milai pawl an rat kha a hmu ih, “Rangpar in mi an ra ka hmu,” tiah a au. Joram cun, “Kanmah ih rualpi an si, ti le kan ral pawl an si, ti zingzoitu ah rang ralkap pakhat in hei thlah aw,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An thlah mipa cun Jehu cu a tong ih a hnenah, “Rualpi ṭha in na ra maw, tiah siangpahrang in theih a duh,” a ti. Cutikah Jehu in, “Cumi cu nangih hnaṭuan a si lo, ka dungin i thlun sawn aw!” a ti. Kotka kiltu cun, “Kan thlah mipa cun a va tong naón a ra kirsal nawn lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Midang an thlah sal ih a hmaisa vek thotho in Jehu cu a va sut ve. Jehu cun, “Cumi cu nangih hnaṭuan a si lo; ka dungin i thlun sawn aw!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule kotka kiltupa cun, “Kan thlah mipa in a va tong naón a ra kir nawn ve lo. An hotu pa in a rangleng cu thli bangin a zamter a si, Jehu a va bang so!” tiah a ti lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuvete in Joram cun, “Ka rangleng rak keng zaang uh!” tiah thu a pek. An rak keng ih Joram le siangpahrang Ahaziah cu anmah ih rangleng veve in Jehu tong dingah an suak. An feh ih Naboth hmuan ah Jehu cu an tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah Joram in, “Thu ṭha in na ra maw?” tiah Jehu cu a sut. Jehu cun, “Na nu Jezebel ih thokmi milem biaknak le polsia leennak in kan ram a khah sungah cun ziang thuṭha so a um thei ding?” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuvete in Joram cu dunglam ah a her ih tlan phah in, “In phiar a sihi, Ahaziah!” tiah a au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutikah Jehu cun a li le thal a suah ih a tha neih patawp in a nawp ih Joram cu a zaang ah a hei sai ih a thal in a lung a hei ngah. Joram cu a rangleng sungah cun a sawn ih a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jehu in amah bawmtu Bidkar hnenah, “A ruak khi la awla Naboth hmuan ah vun hlon aw. Joram ih pa Ahab dung ka thlun laiah nangmah thawn rangpar in hi hrawngah kan feh tlang ih Bawipa in Ahab dodalnak a ṭong ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Mizan ah Naboth le a fapa pawl an that ih an thisen ka hmu a si. Hi hmun thotho ahhin an phu ka la ding, tiah ka lo kam a si,’ a ti kha na ciing lai a si lo maw! Curuangah Bawipa ih sim ciami vekin Joram ruak cu la awla Naboth hmuan ah vun hlon aw,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cumi cu siangpahrang Ahaziah in a hmuh tikah a rangleng in Beth Haggan khua lamah a tlan; a dungin Jehu in a dawi. “Anih khal that uh!” tiah Jehu in a ralkap pawl cu thu a pek; Ahaziah cu Ibleam khua kiang, Gur lamzin ih a rangleng thawn a tlan laiah an hriam. Asinain Megiddo khawpi cu a thleng thei ih cutawk khua ahcun a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A ruak cu a kuthnuai ih bawi pawl in rangleng in Jerusalem ah an phur ih Jerusalem David khawpi, siangpahrang thlaan ah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahaziah cu Ahab ih fapa Joram ih Israel siangpahrang a can kum hleikhatnak ah Judah siangpahrang a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cun Jehu cu Jezreel khua a thleng. Jezebel in thuhla cu a thei thluh ih a mittlang a dumter, a sam a tuah ih siangpahrang inn ih sangkate in a hnuai ih lamzin hrawng a cuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehu cu khawpi kotka in a vung lut ih Jezebel cun, “Maw Zimri! maw mithat pa, hinah ziangso na tuah?” tiah a vun auh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutikah Jehu cun a hun zoh ih, “Ka lamah zoso a ṭang?” tiah a au. Siangpahrang inn ih bawi pahnih thum in sangkate in an vun zoh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />cule Jehu in, “Kha nu kha run hlon uh!” tiah a hun ti. Jezebel cu an vun hlon ih a thisen in phar pawl le an rang pawl cu a ṭeh ṭheh. A ruak par cun Jehu in a rangleng cu a hei mawng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />siangpahrang inn ah lut in rawl a ei. Cuih hnu lawngah, “Kha nunau sualral kha hei sar uhla hei phum uh, siangpahrang fanu a rak si awk hek!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A ruak sar dingah mi hrekkhat an feh ih an zoh tikah a luruh, a keruh le a baanruh lawng an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cumi cu Jehu an va sim tikah anih in, “Hitiin a cang ding, tiah Bawipa in a rak sim ciami a si ko; a salpa profet Elijah hnenin ‘Jezebel ih sa cu Jezreel ram sungah uico in an ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A ruak cu eek bangin an ṭhekdarh ding ih zohman in Jezebel a si ti an theithiam lo ding,’ a rak ti a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Ahab tefa pawl cu Samaria khawpi sungah sawmsarih an um. Jehu in ca pakhat a ngan ih khawpi uktu pawl, ramsung upa pawl le Ahab tefa kilkhawitu upa pawl hnenah a kuat. Cuih a ca sungah cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Siangpahrang tefa kilkhawitu le an hrangih ṭuanvo neitu nan si. Ralhruang kulhmi khawpi pawl, hriamnam pawl, rang le rangleng pawl nan nei ṭhepṭhep. Hi ca nan ngah vete in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />siangpahrang tefa pawl lakih a tlak bik nan timi hril uhla siangpahrang rak ṭuanter uh; cule amah ih lamah ṭangin ral nan do pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Samaria uktu pawl cu an thin a phang ngaingai. Siangpahrang Joram le siangpahrang Ahaziah hman in an neh lomi Jehu cu kannih in ziangtinso kan do thei ding?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah siangpahrang inn uktu bawi, khawpi uktu, ramsung upa pawl le siangpahrang tefa kilkhawitu upa pawl in Jehu hnenah thu an cah ih, “Kannih cu na sal kan si ih na simmi hmuahhmuah kan tuah ṭheh ding. Asinain zohman, ‘Nang siangpahrang si-aw’ tiah kan ti lo ding. A ṭha bik na timi cu tuah ko aw,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Jehu in ca dang pakhat a ngan sal ih, “Ka lam ṭangtu nan si ih ka thupekmi thlun nan tum a si ahcun, siangpahrang Ahab tefa pawl ih lu cu ka umnak Jezreel khua ahhin thaisun tu tikcu ah rak keng uh,” tiah a ti. Siangpahrang Ahab tefa sawmsarih pawl cu Samaria khawpi sungih ummi upa hotu pawl in an kilkhawi ih an zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Jehu ih cakuat an ngah tikah khawsungih upa pawl in Ahab tefa sawmsarih pawl cu an that ih an lu cu bawm sungah an ret ih Jezreel khua Jehu hnenah cun an kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahab tefa ih lu pawl a ra thleng ti kha Jehu an sim tikah anih in cuih lu pawl cu khawpi kotka hmun hnih ah a pen ih a thaizing tiang cutawkih taan dingah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thaizing ah Jehu cu khawpi kotka ah a feh ih cutawkih a rak ummi misenpi hnenah, “Siangpahrang Joram a phiartu le a thattu cu keimah ka si; cuih thu ah nannih ih mawhnak zianghman a um lo. Asinain hipawl hi zo ih thahmi so an si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himi cu Ahab tefa pawl parih Bawipa ih ṭongkam a kim, ti langternak a si. Bawipa amah in a profet Elijah hnenih thu a kammi cu a tuah zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuticun Jezreel khawsungih a ummi Ahab ih sungkhat pawl, a kuthnuai bawi pawl, a rualpi ṭha pawl le a puithiam pawl cu an zatein Jehu in a that ṭheh; pakhat hman hrelh loin a that ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehu cu Jezreel in a suak ih Samaria khua ah a feh. Lamzin ah, “Tuukhal Pawl Riahhmun,” an timi a thlen tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang Ahaziah ih sungkhat pawl a tong. “Zoso nan si?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “Ahaziah ih sungkhat kan si! Jezreel ah siangpahrang bawinu Jezebel ih faale pawl le siangpahrang sungkhat pawl tong dingah le upatnak pe dingah kan vung fehta ding kan ti,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Jehu cun, “A nungin kai ṭheh hai uh,” tiah a ralkap pawl cu thu a pek. An kai hai ih cutawkih khur pakhat kiangah Jehu in an zatein a that ṭheh; minung sawmli le pahnih an si ih pakhat hman taang loin a that ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehu cu a feh sal ih lamzin ah Rekhab fapa Jonadab in a rak hmuak. Jehu in a cibai ih a hnenah, “Ka lo ṭan vekin na thinlung taktein i ṭan maw?” a ti. “Ka lo ṭan,” tiah anih in a ti. Cutikah Jehu in, “Cuti asile na kut i hun saan aw,” a ti. A kut a hun saan ih Jehu in rangleng parah a vun dirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Jehu in, “Ka hnenah hin feh awla Bawipa ih hrangah ziangtlukin so ka taimak, ti cu nangmah tein na hmu ding,” a ti. Cuticun Samaria khawpi ahcun an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An thlen tikah Ahab sungkhat pawl cu Jehu in a that ṭheh; pakhat hman a zuah lo. Bawipa in Elijah hnenih a rak simmi cu a kim ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehu in Samaria mi pawl cu hmun khatah a kokhawm ih an hnenah, “Siangpahrang Ahab in Baal khawzing ih hna cu malte lawng a rak ṭuan. Kei cun nasa zetin ka ṭuan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Baal profet pawl, amah betu pawl le a puithiam pawl, an zatein kokhawm ṭheh uh. Ka ra thiam lo ding, a titu zohman um hlah hai seh; ziangahtile Baal khawzing hnenah thawinak nasa zetin ka tuah ding ih a ra tel lomi cu thah an si ding,” tiah a ti. (Baal betu pawl thah ṭheh duh ah Jehu in hiti in a bum a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Jehu in, “Baal upatnak ah le amah biaknak ah colh ni tuah uh,” tiah thu a pek. A tivek cun an tuah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jehu in, Israel ram sung khuazakip ah thu a than ṭheh. Baal betu hmuahhmuah cu an ra ṭheh; a ra lo pakhat hman an um lo. An zatein Baal biakinn sungah cun an lut ih ke thlaknak hman a lawng lo, an khat ṭhepṭhep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule Jehu in korfual kiltu puithiam hnenah, “Korfual pawl rak suah aw,” tiah thu a pek. Anih in a suah ih Baal a betu pawl hnenah cun a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jehu le Rekhab fapa Jonadab cu biakinn sungah an lut ih Jehu cun an hnenah, “Ralring uh; hi biakinn sungah Bawipa a betu zohman nan tel thei lo ding; Baal a betu lawnglawng tel ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cun Jehu le Jonadab cu raithawinak le mei-ur thawinak pawl pe dingah an lut. Biakinn lengah ralkap sawmriat a rak ret zo ih an hnenah, “Himi pawl hi nan that ṭheh pei; himi pawl pakhatkhat a luattertu cu amah ih nunnak in a kuan ding,” tiah thu a rak pe cia zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jehu in thawinak a pek ṭheh vete in, biakinn kiltu ralkap le bawi pawl hnenah cun, “Lut uhla that ṭheh uh; zohman luat hlah hai seh,” tiah a ti. An ralnam zuuk cia in an lut ih an zatein an that ṭheh ih an ruak pawl cu biakinn lengah an dir. Cuih hnuah an biakinn ih sungta khaan ah an lut ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />cutawkih a ummi Baal lem pawl cu an lak ih an ur ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuticun Baal biakinn le Baal lungphun pawl tla an siatsuah ṭheh ih zun-eek tlannak hmunah an hmang ih tuihsan tiangin an run hmang tata.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cuticun Jehu in Israel ram sungih Baal biaknak cu a balsiat ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Israel a hruai sualtu siangpahrang Jeroboam ih sualnak cu a tuah ve thotho; Bethel le Dan ah sui cawcang lem an biak ih cuih sualnak cu a nunter ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Jehu hnenah, “Ahab tesinfa pawl ih parah tuah dingih ka lo duhsak mi cu na tuah ṭheh. Curuangah na tesinfa pawl cu san linak tiang Israel siangpahrang an si ding, tiah thu ka lo kam,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asinain Jehu in Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian daan cu a thinlung zatein a thlun lo; Israel a hruaisualtu Jeroboam lamzin cu a tlansan thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuih caanah Bawipa in Israel ram cu a fiakter vivo thlang. Siria siangpahrang Hazael in Israel ram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jordan in nisuahnak lam hmuahhmuah, Arnon Tiva kapih a ummi Aroer khawpi tiangin thlanglam ah a vun lak ṭheh. Hi a lakmi sungah Gad hrin, Reuben hrin le Manasseh hrin pawl ih umnak Gilead le Bashan ram pawl an tel ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jehu ih tuahmi, ralṭha zetih a ṭuanmi dangdang pawl cu Israel Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jehu cu a thi ih Samaria ah an phum. A fapa Jehoahaz in a ai ah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehu in Israel ram cu Samaria in kum kul hluanriat sung a uk.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Ahaziah ih nu Athaliah in a fapa an thah kha a theih tikah a fapa Ahaziah ih innsang pawl cu, siangpahrang an cang pang ding ti phan ah a that ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaziah fapa Joash lawng a luat. Amah khal cu thah ding a si naón a ninu Jehosheba in a rak run ngah. (Jehosheba cu siangpahrang Jehoram ih fanu a si ih Ahaziah ih farnu seu a si.) Jehosheba in Joash cu amah umtu nu thawn Biakinn sungih ihnak khaan pakhat sungah a thup ih cutawkah a kilkhawi; cuticun Athaliah in a hmu lo ih a luat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehosheba cun Joash cu kum ruk sung Biakinn sungah a thup ih ṭhatein a zoh; cuih sung cu Athaliah in siangpahrang bawinu a ṭuan ih rampi uktu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain kum sarihnak ah puithiam Jehoiada in siangpahrang bawinu kiltu le siangpahrang inn kiltu bawi pawl cu Biakinn ah a ko ih siatcam in thu a kamter hai ih a tumtahmi cu an hnenah a sim. Siangpahrang Ahaziah ih fapa Joash cu an hmaiah a rak hruai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hiti in thu a pek. “Sabbath ni ih mi kiltu nan si tikah nanmah lakih ṭhen thum ṭhen khat in siangpahrang inn nan kil pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A dang ṭhen khat cu Sur Kotka kiltu nan si pei ih a dang ṭhen khat in kotka kiltu dunglam in nan kil pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sabbath ni ih mi kilvengtu a si lo mi bur hnih pawl tla a hleice in Biakinn ah ṭuanvo nan nei pei ih siangpahrang nan kil pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang Joash cu nan ralnam zuuk cia in nan kil pei ih a fehnak kipah nan thlun pei. A ra lo naihtu poh cu nan that pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puithiam Jehoiada ih thupekmi cu bawi pawl cun an ngai ih an kuthnuai milai pawl, Sabbath ni ih mikiltu a si mi siseh, mikiltu a si lo mi tla siseh, a hnenah an ratter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jehoiada in bawi pawl hnenah cun David ih a rak hmanmi, Biakinn sungih an retmi feipi le ralphaw pawl cu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule mivengtu ralkap pawl Biakinn kimvel ahcun a ret ih an ralnam keng fekfek in siangpahrang cu an kil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Jehoiada in Joash cu a run suahpi ih siangpahrang lukhuh a khum hnuah thukamnak cazual, siangpahrang thuneihnak capi thawn, a pek. Cule hriak a culh ih siangpahrang ah an tuah. Misenpi in an za an beng ih, “Siangpahrang a nunkhua sau hram seh!” tiah an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawinu Athaliah in misenpi le mikiltu pawl an au thawmvang cu a theih tikah misenpi an tonkhawmnak Biakinn ahcun zamrang tein a va feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siangpahrang thar cu, a daan bangtuk in, Biakinn sung luhnak ṭhuam kiangah an dinter ih ralbawi pawl le tawtawrawt tumtu pawl in an kil ṭhepṭhep. Misenpi cu lungawizet in an au; tawtawrawt tum ih an um kha Athaliah cun a hmu. A riahsia in Athaliah cun a hnipuan a thlek ih, “Phiarnak! Phiarnak!” tiah a au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehoiada in Biakinn sungah Athaliah thah a duh lo ruangah ralbawi pawl hnenah, “Kai uhla ralkap pawl ih kil phah in a lengah hei dir uh; amah run a tumtu hmuahhmuah cu that uh,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An kai ih siangpahrang inn ah an hei hruai ih Rang Kotka timi ah an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada cun Bawipa ih miphun an sinak dingah siangpahrang le misenpi cu Bawipa thawn thukamnak a tuahter; siangpahrang le misenpi tla an karlakah thukamnak a tuahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Misenpi cu Baal biakinn ah an feh ih an siatbal ṭheh; biakinn sungih ummi biakṭheng le milem pawl cu an deng kuai thluh. Baal puithiam Mattan tla biakṭheng hmai rori ah an that. Jehoiada in Biakinn ah mikiltu a ret ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />amah le ralbawi pawl, siangpahrang kiltu le siangpahrang inn kiltu pawl in siangpahrang bawipa cu Biakinn ihsin siangpahrang inn ah an fehpi ih misenpi pawl in an thlun. Joash cu Mivengtu Kotka timi in a lut ih siangpahrang tokham parah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah ih thinlung cu lungawinak in a khat; siangpahrang inn sungih ralnam thawn Athaliah an thah hnu cun an khawpi cu a dai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kum sarih a ti ah Joash cu Judah siangpahrang ah a cang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel siangpahrang Jehu in Israel ram a uknak kum sarihnak ah Joash cu Judah siangpahrang a cangih Jerusalem in kum sawmli sung a uk. A nu cu Beersheba khuami Zibiah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joash cu puithiam Jehoiada in a zirh ruangah a dam sung hmuahhmuah ah Bawipa ih duhzawng a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain khawvelmi pawl ih khawzing an biaknak hmun pawl siatsuah loin a zuah ih mi tampi in cutawk hmun ah raithawinak le mei-ur thawinak pawl cu an pe ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joash in puithiam pawl a ko ih, “Pathian betu pawl in an tuah ringringmi thawinak thawn an pek cihmi paisa siseh, anmah lungtho teih pekmi paisa siseh, Biakinn sungih tuahmi thawinak thawn peh-aw ih an pekmi paisa hmuahhmuah cu nan khawl a ṭul ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Puithiam in hna nan ṭuan sakmi Pathian betu pawl ih an pekmi paisa cu ṭhatein nan kil fingfing pei ih a ṭul tik poh ah Biakinn remnak ah hman a si pei,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain siangpahrang Joash in ram a uknak kum kul hluanthum a kim tikah puithiam pawl in Biakinn cu a zianghman hman an rem hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang Joash in Jehoiada le a dang puithiam pawl a ko ih, “Ziangruangah atu tiang Biakinn nan rem dah lo? Atu thokin nan ngahmi paisa cu nanmah in nan kil lo pei. Paisa nan ngahmi hmuahhmuah nan ap pei ih Biakinn kan rem pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anmah in paisa la nawn lo ding le Biakinn khal anmah ih rem lo ding in puithiam pawl an lung a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Jehoiada in kuang pakhat a lak ih a siin ah ong a tuah hnuah biakṭheng kiang, Biakinn vung luh ih vorhlam kamah a ret. Pathian betu pawl ih an pekmi paisa cu Biakinn sangka ih hnaṭuantu puithiam pawl in an rak lak ih cuih kuang sungah cun an san.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kuang sungah paisa a tam thlang a si, ti an theih tikah siangpahrang cazi le Puithiam Sang in paisa cu an siar ih ṭhatein dip in an fun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A zat kha cazin sungah ṭhatein an ngan hnuah Biakinn remtu pawl hotu ih kut ah an pek. Cuticun Bawipa ih Biakinn ih hnaṭuantu zungthiam le inn satu pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />lung dawltu le lung sertu pawl ih hlawhman ah an pek. Biakinn remnak ih a ṭulmi thing-ah, lungto pawl le a dangdang a cemmi hmuahhmuah leinak ah an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain cuih paisa cu ngun khuathai, kheng, tawtawrawt le mei-inn vannak ih hmanmi thilri le a dangdang sui le ngun ih tuahmi thilri leinak ahcun an hmang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Biakinn remnak ih a ṭulmi thilri le a remtu pawl hlawhman lawnglawng ah an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih hnaṭuantu pawl hotu pawl cu rintlak ngaingai an si ih an paisa hman daan kha zingzoi rero a ṭul hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kuansal thawinak ih pekmi paisa le sualthlah thawinak ih pekmi paisa pawl cu cuih kuang sungah an san lo; puithiam pawl ih covo an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Culai ah Siria siangpahrang Hazael in Gath khawpi a do ih a lak; cule Jerusalem khawpi do a tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Judah siangpahrang Joash in a hlanih siangpahrang a rak ṭuantu Jehoshafat, Jehoram le Ahaziah pawl in Pathian hnenih an rak pekmi thawhlawm pawl le Bawipa ih Biakinn tangka retnak sungih a ummi sui hmuahhmuah le siangpahrang inn ih a ummi sui hmuahhmuah cu a lak ṭheh ih siangpahrang Hazael hnenah laksawng ah a kuat. Cutikah Hazael cu Jerusalem do loin a ralkap pawl thawn an kir sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siangpahrang Joash ih tuahmi dangdang pawl cu Judah Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siangpahrang Joash cu a kuthnuai ih ummi bawi pawl in an phiar ih, bawi pahnih Shimeath ih fapa Jozakar le Shomer ih fapa Jehozabad in an that. Silla khua ih vung fehnak lamzin, Millo horkuam ih a ummi inn ah Joash cu an that a si. Jerusalem, David khawpi, siangpahrang thlaan ah an phum ih a fapa Amaziah in a ai ah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaziah fapa Joash cu Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan kum kul hluanthumnak ah Jehu fapa Jehoahaz Israel siangpahrang a cang ih Samaria in kum hleisarih sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hlanih siangpahrang a ṭuantu, Israel mi pawl sualnak ih a hruailuttu siangpahrang Jeroboam bangtuk in Bawipa parah sualnak a tuah ih a thilsual tuahmi cu a thlah thei dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa cu Israel tlunah a thin a heng ih Siria siangpahrang Hazael le a fapa Benhadad in Israel cu voi tampi an neh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun Jehoahaz in Bawipa hnenah thla a cam ih, Israel mi pawl Siria siangpahrang in siava tukih a hrem kha Bawipa in a hmuh ruangah a thlacamnak cu a theih sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel mi hnenah hotu a pek ih cuih hotu cun Siria kut sungin a luatter hai ih a hlan bangtuk in Israel mi pawl cu hnangam in an um sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sikhalsehla siangpahrang Jeroboam in Israel a sualternak ih sualnak cu annih khal in tlansan loin an tuah rero thotho; khawzingnu Asherah ih lem cu Samaria ah a um lai ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehoahaz cun ralkap tampi a nei lo; Siria siangpahrang in a cihmit thluh ih fangcil caan ih leivut bangin a ke hnuai ih a pal beek ṭheh hai ruangah a neihmi zate cu rang ralkap sawmnga, rangleng pahra le ke ralkap thawnghra lawng an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoahaz hnaṭuanmi dangdang le ralṭha zetih a tuahmi pawl cu Israel Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thi ih Samaria ah an phum. Cule a fapa Jehoash in a ai ah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang Joash in Judah ram a uk kum sawmthum le kum sarihnak ah Jehoahaz fapa Jehoash cu Israel siangpahrang a cang ih Samaria in kum hleiruk sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih khal Israel a hruai sualtu siangpahrang Jeroboam ih sualnak cu a tuah ve ih Bawipa ih parah a sual a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehoash hnaṭuannak hmuahhmuah Judah siangpahrang Amaziah thawn an do awk laiah ralṭha zetih a donak pawl cu Israel Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jehoash cu a thi ih Samaria khua, siangpahrang thlaan ah an phum. Cule a fapa Jeroboam pahnihnak in a ai ah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Profet Elisha cu besia zetin a na ih a thih zik zawng ah Israel siangpahrang Jehoash in a va veh. “Maw ka pa, maw ka pa; rangleng le rang ralkap bangin Israel hum theitu!” tiah ṭah phah in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Elisha in, “Li le thal pawl va la aw,” a ti. A tivek cun Jehoash in a lak ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisha in “Sai aw,” a ti ih siangpahrang in a sai tum tikah Elisha in a kut cu siangpahrang ih kut parah a vun ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule profet ih fial vekin siangpahrang cun Siria lamih a ummi sangkate a vun ong. “Na thal cu sai thlang aw,” tiah Elisha cun a ti. Siangpahrang in thal a vun sai vete in profet cun, “Nangmah hi Bawipa ih thal na si ih nangmah hmangin Siria cu a neh ding. Siria pawl cu Afek an timi hmun ah na do ding ih na neh hai ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Elisha in siangpahrang cu, “Na thal dang pawl la awla leilung ah sai aw,” a ti. A tivek cun siangpahrang in leilung cu voi thum a sai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Elisha cu a thin a heng ih, “Voi nga, voi ruk tluk sai cila Siria pawl na neh lanta ding naón! Atu cu voithum tiang lawng na neh ding a si,” tiah siangpahrang cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elisha cu a thi ih an phum. Kumtinte Moab mi, a burbur ih ummi damiah pawl in Israel ram cu an ram ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Voi khat cu mithi an phum laiah cubangtuk damiah bur khat an hmu. Mithi phumtu pawl in an miruak cu Elisha ih thlaan sungah an hlonta ih an tlan. Cule miruak le Elisha ih ruh pawl an dai awk vete in mithi cu a nungsal ih a hung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehoahaz in Israel ram a uk sung hmuahhmuah ah Siria siangpahrang Hazael in Israel mi pawl cu siava zetin a hrem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa cu Israel parah zaangfahnak le lainatnak a nei ih an zawn a ruat; an siat thluh ding cu a siang lo; Abraham, Isaak le Jakob hnenih a thukamnak ruangah Israel mi pawl a bawm ringring. A minung pawl a hngilh dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Siria siangpahrang Hazael a thih tikah a fapa Benhadad siangpahrang a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cun Israel siangpahrang Jehoash in Benhadad cu voithum tiang a neh ih Jehoash ih pa Jehoahaz siangpahrang a si lai ih Benhadad in a rak lakmi khawpi pawl cu a long sal ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoahaz fapa Jehoash in Israel siangpahrang a ṭuan, a kum hnihnak ah Joash fapa Amaziah cu Judah siangpahrang a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah cu kum kul hluannga a si. Jerusalem in kum kul hluankua sung ram a uk. A nu cu Jerusalem khua mi Jehoaddin a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaziah in Bawipa ih duhzawng a tuah; asinain a hlanih siangpahrang David bangtuk cu a si lo. A pa Joash vekin a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawvel mi pawl ih khawzing biaknak pawl a bal lo ruangah mi tampi in thawinak an pek ih rimhmui an ur thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaziah in hngetzet ih ram a hun uk thei tikah a pa, siangpahrang a thattu bawi pawl cu a that hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain an faale pawl cu a that hai lo; Moses Thukham sungih Bawipa ih thupekmi, “An faale pawl sual ruangah an nu le an pa thah an si lo pei; nu le pa sual ruangah an faale pawl thah an si lo pei; amah ih sualnak ruang lawngah minung cu thah a si pei,” timi kha a thlun sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Amaziah in Tipi Thi thlanglam ih Cite Phairawn an timi ah Edom ralkap thawnghra a that. Sela khua a lak ih Joktheel ti ah a hmin a thleng. Tuihsun tiang cutiin an ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Amaziah in Israel siangpahrang Jehoash hnenah, “Do awk ka lo zuam a si,” tiah thu a cah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain siangpahrang Jehoash in, “Voikhat ah Lebanon tlang ah, hlingbur pakhat in Sidar thing hnenah thu a cah ih, “Ka fapa hrangah na fanu i pe aw,” a ti. Sahrang pakhat a kiangin a ra ih hlingbur cu a pal kiak thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Atu-ah Edom mi na neh ruangah na puarthau ih na hngalzet. Na mi nehnak parah na lungkim awla daitein um meen aw. Nangmah le na minung pawl hrangih siatsuahnak a si dingmi thil hi ziangah so na tokhrok rero?” tiah thu a khirh sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Amaziah in cuih thu cu a ngai duh lo. Curuangah siangpahrang Jehoash cu a ralkap pawl thawn an feh ih Judah ram Beth Shemesh an timi hmunah siangpahrang Amaziah thawn an do aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaziah ralkap pawl cu an sung ih an inn ah an tlan ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jehoash in Amaziah cu a kai ih a khawpi Jerusalem khal a lak; khawpi kulhnak lungdawl cu Efraim Kotka in Khawkil Kotka tiang, kaih zahnih sung, a bal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hmuhmi sui le ngun hmuahhmuah, Biakinn thilri le siangpahrang inn ih paisa le hlawnthil hmuahhmuah a lak ih Samaria ah a phur ṭheh. Ral kaihmi tampi tla a hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siangpahrang Jehoash ih thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah, ralṭha zetih Judah siangpahrang Amaziah a donak pawl thawn, Israel Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu ah an ngan ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehoash cu a thi ih Samaria ih siangpahrang thlaan ah an phum. Cule a fapa Jeroboam pahnihnak in a ai ah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel siangpahrang Jehoash a thih hnuah Judah siangpahrang Amaziah cu kum hleinga a rung nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaziah ih hnaṭuan mi hmuahhmuah cu Judah Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem khua sungah Amaziah thah dingih an phiar ruangah Amaziah cu Lakhish ah a tlan; asinain a phiartu pawl cun an thlun ih cutawkah an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ruak cu rang in Jerusalem ah an phur ih David khawpi, siangpahrang thlaan ah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Judah mi pawl in Amaziah ih fapa, kum hleiruk a timi Uzziah cu a ai ah siangpahrang ah an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pa a thih hnuah Elath khua a la saaltu le a din saaltu cu amah Uzziah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joash fapa, siangpahrang Amaziah in Judah ram kum hleinga a uk kumah Jehoash ih fapa Jeroboam pahnihnak cu Israel siangpahrang a cang ih Samaria in Israel ram cu kum sawm li le kum khat sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A hlanih Judah siangpahrang a rak ṭuantu, Israel a hruaisualtu, Nebat ih fapa Jeroboam ih tuahmi thil ṭha lo a thlun ve ruangah Bawipa ih parah a sual a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel ram a rak si dahmi, saklam ah Hamath tlangkawn in thlanglam ah Tipi Thi tiang a lak sal ṭheh. Hi a lakmi cu Gath Hefer khua ih Amittai fapa profet Jonah hnen ihsin Bawipa , Israel Pathian ih pekmi thukam kimternak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel mi pawl, sal siseh miluat siseh, an zate ih an zonzaihnak le an tuarnak cu a hmu ṭheh; asinain zohman bawmtu an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel siatsuah tata ding cu Bawipa ih duhmi a si lo ruangah siangpahrang Jeroboam pahnihnak hmangin Israel cu a hum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jeroboam ih thil tuahmi dang hmuahhmuah, ralṭha zetih ral a donak le Damaskas le Hamath a lak sal thu pawl cu Israel Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jeroboam pahnihnak cu a thi ih siangpahrang thlaan ah an phum; cule a fapa Zekhariah in a ai ah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel siangpahrang Jeroboam pahnihnak in Israel ram a uknak kum kul hluansarih kum ah Amaziah ih fapa Uzziah cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kum hleiruk a ti ah Judah siangpahrang a cang. Jerusalem khua in Judah ram cu kum sawmnga le kum hnih sung a uk. A nu cu Jerusalem khuami Jekoliah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzziah in a pa bangtuk in Bawipa ih duhzawng a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain khawvel pawl ih an khawzing biaknak pawl a siatsuah lo ruangah mi tampi in cutawkah rai an thawi ih rimhmui urnak an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Uzziah parah phaarnat a thlenter ih a nun sung phaarnat a nei tata. A hnaṭuanmi hmuahhmuah mi dangin an sawng ih amah ih inn ah hlimphir in a um; a fapa Jotham in ram pumpi hrangih hnaṭuan cu a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uzziah ih hnaṭuanmi a dang pawl cu Judah Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uzziah cu a thi ih Jerusalem David khawpi, siangpahrang thlaan ah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang Uzziah in Judah ram a uknak kum sawmthum le kum riat kum ah Jeroboam pahnihnak ih fapa Zekhariah cu Israel siangpahrang a cang ih Israel ram cu Samaria khua in thla ruk sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nebat fapa, Israel a hruai sualtu, siangpahrang Jeroboam sualnak a thlun ve ruangah a hlanih siangpahrang a ṭuantu pawl vek thotho in Bawipa ih parah sualnak a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jabesh fapa Shallum in siangpahrang Zekhariah cu phiar tahrat in Ibleam ah a that ih a ai ah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zekhariah ih hnaṭuanmi a dangdang pawl cu Israel Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuticun Bawipa in siangpahrang Jehu hnenah thu a kam ih, “Na tesinfa pawl lakin san linak tiang Israel siangpahrang an ṭuan ding,” a timi cu a kim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siangpahrang Uzziah in Judah ram a uknak kum sawmthum le kum kua kumah Jabesh fapa Shallum cu Israel siangpahrang ah a cang ih Samaria khua in thla khat sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gadi fapa Menahem cu Tirzah in Samaria ah a feh ih siangpahrang Shulam a thah hnuah a ai ah siangpahrang a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Shallum ih hnaṭuanmi a dang pawl, mi a phiarnak thuhla pawl thawn, Israel Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Menahem cu Tirzah ihsin Samaria lamih a feh laiah, Tappuah khawpi in a kotka a rak on duh lo ruangah cuih khua cu a siatbal thluh; khawsungmi pawl a that thluh ih a kiangkap khawte pawl tla a siatsuah ṭheh. Favun nunau hmuahhmuah tiangin a zaithlek thluh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Siangpahrang Uzziah in Judah ram a uknak kum sawmthum le kum kua kumah Gadi ih fapa Menahem cu Israel siangpahrang a cang ih Samaria khua in kum hra sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nebat fapa, a thih tiangih Israel a hruai sualtu, siangpahrang Jeroboam ih sualnak cu Menahem in a thlun ve ih Bawipa ih parah sualnak a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule Assiria siangpahrang Tiglath Pileser in Israel ram a do ih Assiria siangpahrang kut thuai ih Israel siangpahrang a ṭuan thei thothonak dingah Tiglath Pileser hnenah ngun tangka a phurh in phurh thawngkhat a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel ram sungih mi neinung deuhdeuh hnen ihsin mi pakhat ah ngun tangka sawmnga ciar siah a lak. Cuticun Tiglath Pileser cu a ram ah a kir sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Menahem ih hnaṭuanmi dangdang cu Israel Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Menahem cu a thi ih an phum. Cule a fapa Pekahiah in a ai ah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Siangpahrang Uzziah in Judah ram a uknak kum sawmnga kumah Menahem ih fapa Pekahiah cu Israel siangpahrang a cang ih Samaria khua in kum hnih sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nebat fapa, Israel a hruai sualtu, siangpahrang Jeroboam ih sualnak a thlun ruangah Bawipa ih parah sualnak a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pekahiah ralkap sungih ralbawi pakhat, Remaliah ih fapa Pekah in, Gilead mi minung sawmnga thawn Pekahiah a phiar ih Samaria khua, siangpahrang inn sungtabik khaan ah Argob le Areih thawn a that ih a ai ah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pekahiah ih hnaṭuanmi dangdang cu Israel Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siangpahrang Uzziah in Judah ram a uknak kum sawmnga le kum hnihnak ah Remaliah ih fapa Pekah cu Israel siangpahrang a cang ih Samaria khua in Israel ram kum kul sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel a hruai sualtu, Nebat fapa siangpahrang Jeroboam ih sualnak a thlun ve ruangah Bawipa ih mithmuh ah sualnak a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pekah in Israel siangpahrang a ṭuan laiah hin Assiria siangpahrang Tiglath Pileser in Ijon, Abel Beth Maakah, Janoah, Kadesh le Hazor khawpi pawl a lak. Gilead ram, Galilee ram le Naftali ram pawl khal a lak ṭheh ih cuih ram mi tampi Assiria ah salah a hruai hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Uzziah fapa Jotham in Judah siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum kulnak kumah Elah ih fapa Hoshea in siangpahrang Pekah cu a phiar ih a that; cule a ai ah siangpahrang a run ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pekah ih hnaṭuanmi dangdang cu Israel Siangpahrang Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Remaliah ih fapa Pekah in Israel ram a uk kum hnihnak kumah Uzziah fapa Jotham cu Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amah cu siangpahrang a ṭuan ah kum kul hluannga a ti ih Jerusalem ihsin kum hleiruk sung a uk. A nu cu Zadok ih fanu Jerusha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jotham cun a pa Uzziah ih dungthlun in Bawipa ih duh zawng a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Asinain khawvelmi pawl ih khawzing biaknak pawl a siatsuah lo ih mi tampi in cutawkah rai an thawi ih rimhmui an ur ringring. Bawipa ih Biakinn ih Saklam Kotka a tuahtu cu amah Jotham a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jotham ih thil tuahmi dangdang cu Judah Siangpahrang Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jotham in Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan laiah Bawipa in Siria siangpahrang Rezin le Israel siangpahrang Pekah cu Judah do dingin a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jotham cu a thi ih Jerusalem khua, David khawpi siangpahrang thlaan ah an phum. Cule a fapa Ahaz in a ai ah siangpahrang a run ṭuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Remaliah ih fapa Pekah in Israel ram a uk kum hleisarih kumah Jotham ih fapa Ahaz cu Judah siangpahrang a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siangpahrang a ṭuan ah Ahaz cu kum kul a si ih Jerusalem in Judah ram cu kum hleiruk sung a uk. A pu David ih tuahmi thilṭha pawl cu a tuah lo; Bawipa a Pathian ih duh lo zawng a tuah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel siangpahrang dang pawl ih dung a thlun. Israel mi pawl Kanaan ram an luh laiah Kanaan ramih a rak ummi, Bawipa ih a dawihlomi pawl ih tuahmi thil fihnungza pawl a tuah ve. Amah ih fapa rori hman milem hnenah mei-ur thawinak ah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlangzim parah le thingpi niim hnuai kipih khawvel mi pawl khawzing biaknak hmun kipah Ahaz cun rai a thawi ih rimhmui a ur vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siria siangpahrang Rezin le Israel siangpahrang Pekah in Jerusalem khua an do ih an kulh ṭheh; asinain Ahaz cu an neh thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Culai ah Edom siangpahrang in Elath khawpi a lak sal ih cutawkih a ummi Judah mi pawl cu a dawi thluh. Elath khua ah Edom mi an um ih tuihsan tiangin an um lai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Ahaz in Assiria siangpahrang Tiglat Pileser hnen ah thu a cah ih, “Kei cu a lo riantu na siahhlawh le na fapa ka si. Siria siangpahrang le Israel siangpahrang in in do ruangah in ra run hram aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Ahaz in Biakinn ih sui le ngun le siangpahrang inn ih sui le ngun pawl a lak ih Assiria siangpahrang hnenah laksawng ah a kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahaz ih dil vekin Tiglath Pileser cu a ralkap pawl thawn an pok ih Damaskas a do ih a lak; Siangpahrang Rezin cu a thah ih khawsung mi pawl cu Kir khua ah salah a hruai hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Siangpahrang Ahaz cu siangpahrang Tiglath Pileser tong ding in Damaskas khua ih a feh tikah cutawkah biakṭheng a hmu ih cumi vek cekci ih don dingah a ruangrai zingmi pawl kimtein puithiam Uriah hnenah a kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cumi ruangrai vek cun Uriah in biakṭheng pakhat a dawl ih Ahaz a kir sal hlanah a ṭheh thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahaz cu Damaskas ihsin a rung kir tikah biakṭheng an ṭheh zo ti a hmu ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a parah cun thawinakih pekmi ṭilva pawl a ur ih sangphut thawinak pawl tla a pek; cuih tlunah inding thawinakih pekmi sabitti in a toih ih remnak thawinakih pekmi sathi a theh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa ih hrangih thiantermi, darih tuahmi biakṭheng cu biakṭheng thar le Biakinn karlakah a ummi a si ih cumi cu biakṭheng tharih saklam ah a ṭhawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Uriah cu, “Hi ka biakṭheng tumpi cu zinglam mei-ur thawinak le zanlam sangphut thawinak ah hmang awla, siangpahrang le misenpi pawl ih mei-ur thawinak le sangphut thawinak hrangah hmang aw; misenpi ih pekmi inding thawinak hrang tla ah a si ding. Thawinak ih pekmi ṭilva hmuahhmuahih sathi cu a parah toih aw. Asinain dar biakṭheng cu keimah ih hrang lawngah a si pei ih tinzohnak ah ka hmang ding,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Uriah cun siangpahrang ih thupekmi vekin a tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun Siangpahrang Ahaz in Biakinn sungih ummi lengke pawl a bal ih a parih ummi maihum pawl a lak; cule dar cawcang hleihnih dunglam ih ummi dar tikuang a lak ih lungpher phahmi parah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Assiria siangpahrang lungawiternak dingah Ahaz cun Biakinn sungih ummi siangpahrang tokham retnak donhleisang cu a lak hlo ih Biakinn sungih siangpahrang luhnak lamzin cu a phit ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siangpahrang Ahaz ih hnaṭuan mi dangdang cu Judah Siangpahrang Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahaz cu a thi ih Jerusalem, David khawpiih siangpahrang thlaan ah an phum. Cule a fapa Hezekiah in a ai ah siangpahrang a run ṭuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Ahaz in Judah ram a uknak kum hleihnih kumah Elah ih fapa Hoshea cu Israel siangpahrang a cang ih Samaria khua ihsin Israel ram kum kua sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih parah sualnak a tuah; asinain a hlanih Israel a uktu siangpahrang pawl tluk cun a sual lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang Shalmaneser in a do ih Hoshea a sun ruangah kumtinte in Shalmaneser hnenah siah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain voikhat cu Hoshea in Izipt siangpahrang So hnenah mi thlah in bomnak a dil ih kum dang vekin Assiria siangpahrang hnenah siah a pe lo. Cumi cu Shalmaneser in a theih tikah Hoshea cu a kai ih thawngah a thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang Shalmaneser in Israel ram a do ih Samaria khawpi a kulh ṭheh. Kum thum sung a kulh ih a kum thumnak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hoshea in Israel ram a uknak kum kua-nakah Assiria siangpahrang in Samaria khawpi cu a lak. Israel mi pawl cu Assiria ah salah a hruai hai; a hrekkhat cu Halah khua ah a umter, a hrek cu Gozan peng Habor Tiva kiangah a umter ih a hrek cu Media ih khawpi pawl ah a umter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Izipt siangpahrang kut sungin a runsuaktu le Izipt ram in a hruaisuaktu Bawipa an Pathian parih an sual ruangah Samaria khawpi cu ral pawl in an lak a si. Khawzing dang pawl an biak ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa ih a dawihlomi miphun pawl ih daan an thlun ih Bawipa ih duh lomi, Israel siangpahrang pawl ih tuahcopmi daan an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in Bawipa an Pathian ih lungkim lomi thil tampi an tuah. An khawtin ah khawfate in khawtum bik tiang khawvel mi pawl ih khawzing biaknak biakinn pawl an sak ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tlangzim kip le thingpi niim hnuai kipah an khawzing lungphun an phun ih Asherah khawzingnu ih lem an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa ih a dawihlomi miphun pawl ih thiltuah daan cawngin khawzing biaknak biakṭheng parah rimhmui an ur. An thiltuahmi a siatvaat tuk ruangah Bawipa ih thin an hengter;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />milem nan biak lo pei, tiih Bawipa ih thukham pawl cu an siatbal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel mi le Judah mi pawl hnenah a palai pawl le profet pawl a thlah ih, “Thil ṭha lo nan tuahmi taanta uhla nan pipu hnenah ka phuanmi le ka palai profet pawl hmangin nan hnenih ka lo pekmi ka thukham le ka Daan pawl cu thlun uh,” tiah ralrinnak voi tampi a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an ngai duh lo; Bawipa an Pathian a rak rinsan lotu an pupa pawl vekin an thinlung cu a ruh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thupekmi pawl an thlun duh lo; an pupa pawl thawn thukamnak a tuahmi an hngetter lo ih a ralrinnak pekmi zianghman ah an siar lo. A ṭhahnem lomi milem pawl an biak ih mi ṭhahnem lo ah an cang. An kiangkapih ummi miphun pawl ih thiltuah daan pawl an cawng ih, “Nan cawng lo pei,” tiih Bawipa ih thupek an el.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa an Pathian ih pekmi Daan hmuahhmuah an balsiat ṭheh ih daar ih tuahmi cawcang pahnih an biak. Cuih tlunah khawzingnu Asherah ih lem an tuah, arsi an biak ih Baal khawzing an rian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawvel pawl ih khawzing hnenah an fanu le an fapa pawl mei-ur thawinak ah an pek; pol pawl le kutṭial zohthiam pawl an leeng ih Bawipa hmaiih thil ṭha lo an theihmi hmuahhmuah kimtein an tuah. Curuangah Bawipa ih thin an hengter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa cu Israel mi parah a thin a heng ih a hmuh lonak ramah a dawihlo hai a si; curuangah Judah ram lawng a zuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain Judah mi pawl tla in Bawipa an Pathian ih thupekmi an thlun lo; Israel mi ih thiltuah daan an zir ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel mi pawl cu a hnong, a hrem ih mi zaangfah nei lo an ral pawl ih kutah a pek hai; neta bikah a hmuh lonak ramah a dawihlo hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel ram cu Judah ram ihsin a ṭhensuak tikah Nebat fapa Jeroboam cu Israel mi pawl in an siangpahrang ah an tuah. Jeroboam ruangah an Bawipa cu an tlansan ih tuksumza sualnak sungah a hruailut hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jeroboam an thlun ih sualnak a tuahmi cu an tuah ve ringring;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />neta bikah, profet a sal pawl hnenin, “Ka tuah ding,” tiih ralrinnak a pek vekin, a hmuh lonak hmunah a dawihlo hai a si. Cuticun Israel mi pawl cu Assiria ramah hruai ṭheh an si ih atu khalah cutawkah an um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang in Babilon, Kuth, Ivvah, Hamath, le Sefarvaim khawsungmi pawl a suahter hai ih thawngih a thlakmi Israel mi pawl ai-ah Samaria ram khawpi pawl ahcun a umter hai. Cuih khawpi pawl cu an luah ih an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An um pek ahcun Bawipa an bia duh lo; curuangah Bawipa in kiosa pawl a thlah ih minung tawkfang an deh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cumi thu cu Assiria siangpahrang an sim ih Samaria khawpi pawl sungih a umtermi pawl in cuih ram khawzing ih daan an theih lo ruangah an khawzing in kiosa a thlah ih a deh hai a si, tiah a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Curuangah Assiria siangpahrang in, “Thawng ih kan thlakmi an puithiam lakih pakhat cu kuat kir uh; kir in vung um sehla cuih ram khawzing ih daan cu cuih khawsungih mi pawl hnenah zirh seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah Samaria in an rak hruai ih Assiria ramih thawng an thlak mi puithiam pakhat cu an fehter ih Bethel ah a um; cutawkah cun Bawipa biak daan pawl a zirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Asinain Samaria ih a ummi pawl cun an rak biakmi khawzing lem cu an tuah cio ih Israel mi pawl ih an rak sakmi khawzing biakinn sungah cun an ret. An umnak ciar khawpi sungah cun an hrin ciar in milem an tuah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babilon mi pawl in an khawzing Sukkoth Benoth lem an tuah; Kuth mi pawl in an khawzing Nergal lem an tuah; Hamath mi pawl in an khawzing Ashima lem an tuah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ivvah mi pawl in an khawzing Nibhaz le Tartak lem an tuah; Sefarvaim mi pawl in an khawzing Adrammelek le Anammelek pawl hnenah an faale pawl cu mei-ur thawinak ah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Annih in Bawipa tla an bia ve thotho ih an khawvel khawzing biaknak hmunih puithiam ṭuantu dingah le an hrangih thawinak petu dingah anmah lakih sin miphun dangdang an hril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuticun Bawipa biak le anmah ih khawzing ciar biak cu an ceem; an rak ratnak khua le ramih thiltuah daan cu an thlun thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuihsun tiangah hin cuih an thiltuah daan hlun cu an thlun lai. Bawipa cu an bia nawn lo; Bawipa in Jakob tesinfa pawl Israel tiih a kawhmi hnenih a pekmi daan le thukham pawl tla an thlun lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel mi thawn thukamnak a rak tuah tikah an hnenah, “Khawzing dangdang nan bia lo pei; an hmaiah nan kuun lo pei ih nan rian lo pei; thawinak tla nan pe lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin huham le baan thacak thawn a lo suahtu Bawipa keimah lawng hi in ṭihzah pei. Keimah hnenah thawinak pawl nan pek pei ih ka hmaiah nan kuun pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nan hrangih ka nganmi daan le thukham hmuahhmuah nan thlun ringring pei. Khawzing dang pawl ih thu nan thlun lo pei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />nanmah thawn ka tuahmi thukam cu nan hngilh lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bawipa nan Pathian keimah cu in ṭihzah pei ih nan ral pawl ih kut sung ihsin ka lo runsuak hai ding,” tiah thu a rak pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sikhalsehla hi miphun pawl cun an ngai lo; an thiltuah daan hlun sawn an thlun ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cuticun hi miphun pawl in Bawipa biak le an milem pawl biak cu an ceem; tuihsun tiangin an tesinfa pawl in cuticun an tuah ringring a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elah ih fapa siangpahrang Hoshea in Israel ram a uk kum thumnak ah Ahaz ih fapa Hezekiah cu Judah siangpahrang a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah cu kum kul hluannga a ti ah siangpahrang a ṭuan ih Jerusalem in Judah ram cu kum kul hluankua sung a uk. A nu cu Zekhariah ih fanu Abijah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah cu a pu David dungthlun in Bawipa ih duhzawng a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawvel mi ih khawzing biaknak hmun pawl a siatsuah ṭheh ih an lungphun thianghlim pawl a khuai ṭheh; khawzingnu Asherah hrangih an phun mi thamzarh ṭhuam pawl tla a hau ṭheh. Moses ih a rak tuahmi dar rul Nehustan tiih an kawhmi, cuihsan tiang Israel mi pawl in upatnak thawn a hmaiih rimhmui an urmi cu, a khuai seksek thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hezekiah in Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian cu a rinsan a si. A hlanah siseh, a hnu khalah siseh, Judah siangpahrang lakah Hezekiah bangtu siangpahrang zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah rintlak a si ih a thu a el dah lo; Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupekmi hmuahhmuah felzetin a thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa cu a hnenah a um ih a thiltuahmi hmuahhmuah ah a hlawhtling a si. Assiria siangpahrang tla a do ih siah peknak in a luat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Filistin mi a neh ih an khua le ram pawl cu khawfate bik ihsin khawpi bik tiang, Gaza le a kiangkap khua pawl tla a ram ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezekiah in Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan kum linak, le Hoshea in Israel siangpahrang a ṭuan kum sarih kumah Assiria siangpahrang Shalmaneser in Israel ram cu a do ih Samaria khawpi cu a kulh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum thum sung a kulh hnuah Samaria cu a lak. Himi cu Hezekiah in Judah ram a uk kum ruknak le Hoshea in Israel ram a uk kum kuanak ah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang in Israel mi pawl cu Assiria ramah a hruai hai ih a hrek cu Halah khua, a hrek cu Gozan peng Habor Tiva kiangkap le a hrek cu Media khawpi pawl ah a umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in Bawipa an Pathian ih thupekmi an ngai lo ruangah Samaria cu Assiria mi in an lak a si. Bawipa salpa Moses hnen ihsin Israel mi thawn Bawipa ih thukamnak a tuahmi cu an siatbal thluh ih an thlun duh lo. A thu an ngai lo ih a thukam khal an thlun lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siangpahrang Hezekiah in Judah ram a uk kum hleilinak ah Assiria siangpahrang Sennakherib in Judah ram sungah ralhruang ih kulhmi khawpi pawl a do ih tampi a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Hezekiah in Sennakherib hnenah, Lakhish ih a um laiah mi a thlah ih, “Ka mawh a si; i do nawn hlah aw; i ngenmi hmuahhmuah ka lo pe thluh ding,” tiah a ti. Assiria siangpahrang in thu a run khirh ih a ngenmi cu ngun tangka a phurh in phurh zahnih le sawmnga le sui phurh kul hluannga a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekiah in Bawipa ih Biakinn sungih ngun tangka hmuahhmuah le siangpahrang inn ih ngun tangka pawl a kuat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Biakinn sangka sui ih khuutmi le Hezekiah amah rori in sangka ṭhuam pawl sui in a khuutmi ih sui pawl cu a lak ih Sennakherib a kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang cun Lakhish ihsin Jerusalem ih ummi Hezekiah do dingah ralkap tampi a run thlah ṭhiamṭhiam. Cuih ralkap pawl cu a kuthnuai ih bawi tumbik pathum in an ho. Jerusalem khua cu an thleng ih Tlunta Tili ihsin tidai rung luannak horkuam kiang, hnipuan taktu pawl umnak lamzin ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang Hezekiah cu an ko ih anih in a kuthnuai bawi pathum - siangpahrang inn kiltu pawl hotu Hilkiah ih fapa Eliakim, siangpahrang zungih sungṭuan Shebna le cazin kaih lamih hotu Asaf ih fapa Joah a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Assiria bawi pakhat in an hnenah, “Ziangah so siangpahrang Hezekiah hi hiti lawmmam ih a rinsan awk tihi kan siangpahrang ih theih duhmi a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Raldonak lamih thiamnak le cahnak hi kaa lawngin a ai rawl thei ding, tiah nan zum maw si? Assiria do dingah zo ih ṭanpinak so nan rinsan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Izipt in in bawm ding nan ti maw? Rinsan duh hlah uh! Nan rinsan asile phaikung kianghrol hmang vek nan si ding - a kiak ding ih nan kut riangri a lo aat hai ding. A rinsantu hrangah Izipt cu cuti ringring a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Asilo talle, ‘ Bawipa kan Pathian kan rinsan a si,’ in ti ding maw? Nan siangpahrang Hezekiah amah a si lo maw, Bawipa ih biakinn pawl le biakṭheng pawl cu a siatbal thluh ih Jerusalem ih biakṭheng lawngah Pathian nan biak ding, tiah Judah mi le Jerusalem khawsungmi pawl a titu cu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nan ngam ngai maw? Assiria siangpahrang hmin in ka lo zuam hai a si: rang to theitu milai thawnghnih nan um a si ahcun rang thawnghnih ka lo pe thei hai ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Assiria ralkap sungih ralbawi nauta bik hman nan tluk loih nannih cun Izipt mi pawl in rangleng le rang ralkap pawl in kuat hai sehla, nan hei ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa ih bomnak tel loin nan ram hi kan do ih kan siatsuah ah maw si nan ruat? Thungai ih ti ahcun, Bawipa amah rori in nan ram hi do ding le siatsuah dingah thu i pek sokhaw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutikah Eliakim, Shebna le Joah cun Siria bawi hnenah, “Bawipa, kannih hnenah cun Aramaik ṭong in ṭong aw. Kan thei ko a si. Hebru ṭong cun ṭong hlah aw; khawpi kulhnak lungdawl parih minung pawl in in ngai a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule anih in, “Siangpahrang in i thlah tikah, hipawl hi nanmah le nan siangpahrang hnen lawngih ṭong dingah i thlah ah maw si nan ruat? Asilo sokhaw! Nanmah le ralhruang parih a tomi, mah ih eek a ei ding le mah ih zun a in dingmi pawl, nan zate hnenih ṭong dingah a si i thlah,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cule ding tahratin Hebru ṭong in, “Maw milai pawl, Assiria siangpahrang ih a lo simmi hi ngai uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hezekiah hin lo bum rero hlah seh, tiah ralrinnak a lo pe a si. Hezekiah cun a lo run thei hrimhrim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bawipa rinsan dingih a lo simmi tla hi zum hlah uh. Bawipa cun in run dingih Assiria ralkap pawl in kan khawpi cu an la lo ding, tiah ruat duh hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hezekiah ih thu cu ngai hlah uh. Assiria siangpahrang in thu a lo pek hai a si: khawpi sungin rasuak uhla remnak ra tuah uh. Assiria siangpahrang in nanmah ih ram a bangmi ram sungah, sabit ngahnak dingah sabit hri a umnak, sang tuahnak dingah fang a umnak, olif umnak le olif hriak le khuaitizu umnak ram sungih a lo umter hlan lo cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />nanmah ih sabit hri in sabit rah nan ei ding, nanmah ih theipi kung in theipi nan ei ding ih nanmah ih tikhur in tidai nan in ko ding. Bawipa in in hum ding, tiah Hezekiah hin lo bum rero hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang ih neh lo dingin khawzingih a runsuakmi mi phun dang pawl an um maw? I sim hnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khuiah so Hamath khawzing le Arpad khawzing pawl an si ṭheh? Khuiah so Sefarvaim khawzing, Hena khawzing le Ivvah khawzing pawl an hlohral ṭheh? Zotal in Samaria khawpi an hum thei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ziangtik ah so hi ram pawl hi an khawzing pawl in an hum ih Assiria siangpahrang kut in an luat, ti nan theih dah? Jerusalem cu Bawipa in a hum ding, tiah ziangtinso nan zum thei?” tiah a au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Misenpi pawl cu an dai khepkhep! Siangpahrang Hezekiah ih a sim hai vekin zohman in zianghman an ṭong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule Eliakim, Shebna le Joah cu an riahsia in an hnipuan an thlek ih Assiria ralbawi ih ṭong cu siangpahrang hnenih sim dingin an ra.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Hezekiah in cuih thu a theih vete in a riahsia in a hnipuan a thlek ih buri hnipuan a hruk ih Bawipa ih Biakinn ah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siangpahrang inn kiltu bawi Eliakim, Siangpahrang zungih sungṭuan Shebna le puithiam hotu deuhdeuh pawl cu Amoz ih fapa profet Isaiah hnenah siangpahrang in a thlah hai. A thlahmi pawl tla buri hnipuan an hruk ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siangpahrang in Isaiah hnenah cun, “Tuihsun cu lungphang le thinpit ih kan um sun a si; kawk kan tuar ni a si ih ningzak mualpho ih kan um ni khal a si. Thazaang a neih lo ruangih nau a hring thei nawn lomi nunau kan bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang in a kuthnuai bawi lakih upabik a run thlah ih a nungmi Pathian cu a hmuhsuam ciamco. Bawipa na Pathian in hi hmuhsuamnak ṭongkam hi thei in cutiih a ṭongtu cu run hrem hram seh. A nung hrihmi kan minung pawl hrangah Pathian hnenah thla in cam sak hram aw,” tiah a cah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isaiah in siangpahrang ih thucahmi a theih tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hiti in thu a khirh: “ Bawipa in, ‘Assiria siangpahrang kuthnuai bawi pawl in an lo hro ih keimah in hmuhsuamnak ṭong ruangah zianghman thinphannak nei hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang sungah thinlung ka ret ding; cutikah thuvaivuan a thei ding ih a ramah a kir ding; cutawkah amah ih ram sungih ralnam in ka thihter ding,’ a ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih Assiria bawi in an siangpahrang cu Lakhish a suahsan ih a kiangih ummi Libnah khawpi a do, ti a theih tikah, a kir ih cutawk ahcun amah tong dingin a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Assiria siangpahrang in, anmah Assiria ralkap pawl do dingah Izipt ralkap pawl cu Ethiopia Siangpahrang Tirhakah ho in an ra, tiah thu a thei. Cutikah Assiria Siangpahrang in Judah siangpahrang Hezekiah hnenah palai a thlah sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na rinsanmi na Pathian cun ka kut sungih tla lo dingin thu a lo sim, asinain cumi cun lo hnangamter pang hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Assiria Siangpahrang in ‘Ka siatsuah ding,’ tiih ka ti hnuhnu cu an ram ziangti in a um ṭheu ti cu na theih cia a si ko. Ka luat thei ding, tiah na ruat maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka pupa pawl in Gozan, Haran le Rezef khawpi pawl an siatsuah thluh zo ih Telassar ih ummi Betheden mi pawl an that ṭheh; an khawzing zotal in an hum thei ti na thei dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Atu-ah Hamath, Arpad, Sefarvaim, Hena le Ivvah khawpi ih siangpahrang pawl cu khuiah so an um?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siangpahrang Hezekiah in Assiria siangpahrang ih cakuat mi cu a palai pawl ih kut in a lak ih a siar. Cule Bawipa ih Biakinn ah a feh ih Bawipa ih mithmuh ah cuih ca cu a ret ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />thla a cam: “Maw Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian, cherub ih thla tlun sunloihnak bawi tohkham ih a totu, Nangmah lawng Pathian na si ih leilung tlunih peng le ram hmuahhmuah tla a uktu na si. Lei le van hi nangmah ih tuahmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , atu kan parih a thlengmi thil hi in run hmuhsak hram aw. Assiria siangpahrang Sennakherib in a nungmi Pathian nangmah a lo nautatnak ṭongkam hmuahhmuah cu run thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , Assiria siangpahrang pawl in miphun tampi an siatsuah ih an ram pawl an ṭhingter;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />pathian a si lomi an khawzing pawl - khawzing hman si lo, milai kut ih thing le lung tuahcopmi - milem pawl cu an ur ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa kan Pathian, leilung pumpi in Bawipa , nangmah pakhat lawnglawng Pathian taktak na si kha an lo theih theinak dingah Assiria mi pawl ih kut sungin in runsuak hram aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Isaiah in Siangpahrang Hezekiah hnenah thu a cah ih, “ Bawipa in na thlacamnak a thei zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Assiria Siangpahrang Sennakherib dodal in Bawipa ih ṭongkam cu hiti in a si: ‘Zion ih fala in a lo nautat, Zion fala him in a lo hmuhsuam; Jerusalem fanu in a lu a thing, Dungsiip ih na tlanhlo tikah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na camriam, na hmuhsuam reromi, Zo a si tiah so na ruat? Na auh reromi hi zoso a si? Israel ih Pathian thianghlim, Keimah i hmuhsuam sokhaw na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka hnenih tluangkhawng dingin, na palai na thlah; Ka rangleng pawl thawn tlang sang bik ka neh, Lebanon tlangzim tla ka thleng, Sidar thing saangbik ka hau thei, Mirang farthing ṭha bik tla, Tupi sungih a deng bik hmun ka thleng, Ram netnak phuul tiang, na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hrindangmi ramah tikhur ka lai, Cutawkih tidai ka in, Ka ralkap pawl in Nail Tiva pawl an ke rori in an pal, Car ṭheh in an pal, tiah na porh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />‘Hitiih na tuahmi hmuahhmuah hi Hlanlaipi in Keimah ih tumcia mi a si, tihi na thei dah lo maw? Atu lawngah ka tuahsuak a si! Ralhruang kulh mi khawpi pawl cu Siatbal thluh theinak ah huham ka lo pek;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khawsungih ummi minung pawl cu, Thilti theinak an nei riai lo. Ṭihnak le thlaphannak in an khat. Lo sungih a kho mi belh le Inn parih a khomi hrampi vek an si, Thlisia a hran ih a nuai tikah an vuai ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘Na thuhla cu a zatein ka thei ṭheh zo, Na tuahmi le na fehnak pawl thawn; Ka parih na thinhenzia pawl thawn Kimtein ka thei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka hnenih na thinhennak le Ka parih na hngalnak pawl cu, Ka hna an thleng ṭheh. Curuangah na hnar ah sio ka thlaih ding ih, Na kaa ah kakharh ka kharh ding, Cuticun na ratnak lamzin in, Ka lo hruaikir sal ding,’” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule Isaiah in Siangpahrang Hezekiah hnenah, “A cang dingmi thil hminsinnakah hiti in a si ding: Tuihkum le hmaikum cu hramlakih a khomi fang nan ei ding. Asinain kum thumnak kum ahcun nanmah in rawlci nan tuh pei ih nanmah in rawl nan lak ding; sabit tla nan ciing pei ih sabit rah nan ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Judah ramah a nung ih a taangsunmi pawl cu a thukpi ah hrihhram a dawt ih rah a rahmi thingkung vek an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jerusalem le Zion Tlang tla ah a taangmi an um ding; ziangahtile Bawipa in a kimter tengteng ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Assiria siangpahrang thu ahcun Bawipa in hiti in a ti: ‘Hi khawpi sungah a lut lo ding, Thal pakhat khal a sai lo ding. Ralphaw thawn a ralkap pawl cu, khawpi hmai an ra thleng lo ding. Phardawl lengih raldonak leidawl, khahsilh mi tla an dawl lo ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A ratnak lamzin in a kirsal pei, Hi khawpi sungah cun a lut lo pei. Bawipa Keimah in ka phuang zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hi khawpi cu ka ṭan pei ih ka hum pei, Ka hmin thannak hrangah le Ka salpa David hnenih ka thukam mi ruangah.’” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cuih zan cu Bawipa ih vancungmi pakhat Assiria ralkap pawl ih riahhmun ah a feh ih ralkap thawng zakhat thawng sawmriat le thawngnga a thah. A thaizing zingpit ahcun an zatein an thi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cule Assiria Siangpahrang Sennakherib cu dungah a siip ih Nineveh ah a kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Voikhat ah a khawzing Nisrok biakinn ih a khawzing a biak laiah a fapa pahnih Adrammelek le Sharezer in an ralnam in an sun that ih cuih hnuah Ararat ramah an tlan. A ai ah a fapa Esarhaddon in siangpahrang a run ṭuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih ṭumah Siangpahrang Hezekiah cu besia zetin a na. Amoz ih fapa profet Isaiah in a va veh ih a hnenah: “ Bawipa in, ‘Ro na cah duhmi tla cahta aw; ziangahtile na nung lo ding; na thi ding,’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Hezekiah cu phar lamah a her ih thla a cam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa , nangmah ih rinsantlak le thinlung ka neihmi zate thawn na hna ka ṭuan ih na hmaiah a ṭhami lawnglawng ka tuah, ti na thei thluh ko,” a ti ih napi in a ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isaiah cu a suak ih a feh; asinain siangpahrang inn ih khaan laifang a lan hlanah Bawipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“ Bawipa ih minung pawl uktu Hezekiah hnenah kirsal awla a hnenah, ‘ Bawipa keimah, na pu David ih Pathian in na thlacamnak cu ka thei ih na mitthli cu ka hmu zo. Ka lo damter ding ih ni thum sungah Biakinn ah na feh thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuih hnu kum hleinga na nung hrih ding. Nangmah le hi khawpi cu Assiria siangpahrang kut in ka lo runsuak ding. Hi khawpi cu ka hminthannak ah le ka salpa David hnenih ka thukam mi ruangah ka hum ding, a ti,’ va ti aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Isaiah in siangpahrang hnen-um pawl hnenah, “A khuaihli hma ah theipi rah ih tuahmi sii hnih uhla a dam ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang Hezekiah cun, “ Bawipa in i damter dingih ni thum sungah Biakinn ah ka feh thei ding, tiih khihhmuhnak cu ziangso a si ding?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Isaiah in, “ Bawipa in a thukam mi a kimter ding, ti langternak ah khihhmuhnak a lo pe ding. Phenthla cu hmailam ah karbak pahra ṭhawnter na duh maw, asilole dunglam ih karbak pahra kirter na duh sawn?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekiah in, “Phenthla hmailam ih kar hra ṭhawn cu a ol deuh ding; dunglam ah kirter aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Isaiah in, Bawipa ih hnenah thla a cam ih, Bawipa in phenthla cu Siangpahrang Ahaz ih tuahmi kailawn ih a suh vivo laiah dunglam ah kar hra a kirter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih caanah Baladan ih fapa, Babilon Siangpahrang Merodak Baladan in siangpahrang Hezekiah a na, ti a thei ih ca le laksawng a run kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Hezekiah cun Babilon ihsin a rami palai pawl cu ṭhazet in a rak zoh hai ih a lennak hmuahhmuah, a sui le a ngun, a rimhmui pawl le a ralkap pawl ih hriamnam pawl tiangin a hmuh thluh hai. A thilri le a thilthuam pawl retnak khaan ta siseh, a ram sungih ummi thilri dangdang siseh, a hmuh lomi zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule profet Isaiah cu Siangpahrang Hezekiah hnenah a feh ih, “Hi milai pawl cu khuitawk inso an rat? Na hnenah ziangso an reel?” tiah a sut. Cutikah Hezekiah in, “Annih cu ram hlapi, Babilon ram in an ra a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isaiah in, “Siangpahrang inn sungah ziangso an zoh?” a ti. Hezekiah cun, “Ziang hmuahhmuah an zoh ṭheh. Thilri retnak sungih ta ka hmuh hai lomi zianghman a um lo,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Isaiah in siangpahrang hnenah, “ Bawipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Na pupa pawl in tuihsun tiang an khawlmi thilri pawl hi Babilon a thlen thluh caan a ra thleng ding. Zianghman a taang lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangmah ih sungsuak na tefa hrekkhat pawl tla an hruai hai ding ih Babilon siangpahrang inn ah an til per tahratin hnaṭuantu an si ding,’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutiih a timi cu Siangpahrang Hezekiah cun, “Ka nun sungah cun daihnak le humhimnak a um ding a si cu,” tiih a ruah ruangah Isaiah hnenah, “ Bawipa ih ṭong, in run thanmi cu a ṭha a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siangpahrang Hezekiah ih thil tuah mi dangdang, ralṭha zetih hna a ṭuannak, khawpi hrangah tidai khawlnak tumpi a tuah ih leihnuai in tikong a tuahmi pawl thuhla cu Judah Siangpahrang Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hezekiah cu a thi ih a fapa Manasseh in a ai ah siangpahrang a run ṭuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh cu kum hleihnih a ti ah Judah siangpahrang a cang ih Jerusalem ihsin Judah ram kum sawmnga le kum nga sung a uk. A nu cu Hefzibah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mi Kanaan ram an luh laiah Bawipa ih a dawihlo mi miphun pawl ih fihnungza thiltuah daan pawl a thlun ruangah Manasseh cu Bawipa ih parah a sual.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Manasseh in a pa Hezekiah ih a siatbal thluh zomi khawzing an biaknak inn pawl cu a thar in a sak sal; Baal khawzing biaknak biakṭheng pawl a don ih Israel Siangpahrang Ahab ih a rak tuah zo bangin khawzingnu Asherah lem tla a tuah. Manasseh cun arsi pawl tla a biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in amah biaknak hrangah a timi Bawipa Biakinn sungah cun khawzing dang pawl biaknak hrangah biakṭheng pawl a dawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa Biakinn ih khaan pahnih sungah arsi pawl biaknak ah biakṭheng pahnih a dawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mei-ur thawinak hrangah a fapa tiangin a pek. Aizingnak le mitkher a tuah; kutṭial zohthiam pawl le tinzohthiam pawl a leeng. Bawipa ih mithmuh ah a sualnak cu a siazet ih Bawipa thin a hengter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa ih Biakinn hmun thu ah Bawipa in David le a fapa Solomon hnenah, “Jerusalem khawpiih hi Biakinn cu Israel miphun hleihnih pawl ih ram hmuahhmuah lakah keimah biaknak hrangih ka hril mi hmun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in ka thupekmi an ngai ih ka salpa Moses ih pekmi Daan cu kimten an thlun ṭheh a si ahcun an pupa hnenih ka rak pekmi hi ram ihsin zohman in an dawisuak hai lo ding,” tiah a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Judah mi pawl in Bawipa ih thu cu an ngai lo. Kanaan ram an luh laiah Bawipa ih dawihlo mi miphun pawl ih thilsual an tuahmi hnakin luar deuh in thilsual Manasseh in a tuahter hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in a siahhlawh profet pawl hnenin a phuang ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kanaan mi pawl ih rak tuahmi sualnak hnakin thilsual deuh, fihnung tuksumza sualnak cu Manasseh in a tuah zo a si; a milem pawl biaknak in Judah cu a sualter zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah Israel Pathian Bawipa keimah in Jerusalem le Judah parah siatsuahnak nasa zetin ka thlenter ding ih a hmutu le a theitu pawl an mang a bang ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samaria ka hrem vekin le Israel Siangpahrang Ahab le a tefa pawl ka hrem bangtuk in Jerusalem ka hrem ding. Jerusalem cu milai zohman um lo tiangin ka thenfai thluh ding - an hnawtfai mi pakan cu a khupih an ret vekin Jerusalem cu ka kholhfai thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A taangsunmi milai pawl khal ka dungtun ding ih an ral pawl kutah ka pe hai ding; an ral pawl le a dotu pawl in an ram cu an siim dingih an thilri pawl an ram thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keimah ih miphun an si ko naón, Izipt ramih an suah ni thokin tuihsun tiang ka parah an sual ringring. Ka thin in hengter tuk thlang ruangah hi bangtuk thil cu an parah ka tuah ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Manasseh in mawhnak zianghman a nei lomi minung pawl tamtuk a that ih Jerusalem khawpi lamzin ah thisen a luang ciamco. Himi cu Judah mi pawl milem biaknak ah a hruai hai ruangah Bawipa parih misual a siternak hlei ah a tuahmi sualnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Manasseh thil tuahnak dangdang le a sual tuahmi pawl cu Judah Siangpahrang Pawlih Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Manasseh cu a thi ih siangpahrang innih hmuan, Uzza hmuanah an phum. Cule a fapa Amon in a ai ah siangpahrang a run ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amon cu kum kul hluanhnih a ti tikah Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan ih Jerusalem ihsin kum hnih sung a uk. A nu cu Jotbah khuami Haruz ih fanu Meshullemeth a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pa Manasseh vekin Bawipa ih mithmuh ah a sual;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a pa ih thiltuahmi a cawng ih a pa ih biakmi milem pawl cu a bia ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pu le a pa pawl ih Pathian Bawipa cu a hnong ih a thupekmi a thlun duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kuthnuai ih bawi pawl in Amon cu an phiar ih siangpahrang inn sungah an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asinain Judah mi pawl in Amon thattu bawi pawl cu an that ih a ai ah a fapa Josiah siangpahrang ah an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amon ih hnaṭuanmi dang pawl cu Judah Siangpahrang Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amon cu Uzza hmuan sungah an phum; cule a fapa Josiah in a ai ah siangpahrang a run ṭuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah cu kum riat a ti ah Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan ih Jerusalem ihsin kum sawmthum le kum khat sung a uk. A nu cu Bozkath khuami Adaiah ih fanu Jedidah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Josiah cu Bawipa ih duhzawng a tuah; a pu siangpahrang David ziaza a thlun ih Pathian ih thupekmi pawl felzet in a thlun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siangpahrang Josiah in Judah ram a uknak kum hleiriatnak ah Meshullam ih tupa, Azaliah ih fapa, siangpahrang zungih sungṭuan Shafan cu Bawipa ih Biakinn ah a thlah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Puithiam Sang Hilkiah hnenah va feh awla mi pawl ih pekmi paisa cu Biakinn sangka kiltu puithiam pawl in ziangzat an khawl zo, ti va sut aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuih paisa cu Biakinn remtu pawl hotu hnenih pek dingah va sim aw. Hnaṭuantu hotu pawl in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />zungthiam, inn satu, le lungdawltu pek dingah le inn remnak ih a ṭulmi zanthing le lungto pawl leinak ah an hmang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnaṭuan hotu pawl cu zumtlak ngaingai an si ih an paisa hmannak pawl zingzoi rero a ṭul lo ding,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang ih thupekmi cu Shafan in Hilkiah a va sim. Cutikah Hilkiah in Biakinn sungih Daan cabu a sarnak thu a rak sim. Hilkiah in cuih cabu cu Shafan a pek ih Shafan cun a siar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang hnenah a kir ih, “ Bawipa ih Biakinn sungih paisa cu na salpa pawl in an lak ih hnaṭuan hotu pawl hnenah an pe ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun hinah Hilkiah ih i pekmi cabu a um,” tiah a ti. Cule siangpahrang hnenah ringzet in a siar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cumi Daan cabu sungih thu cu siangpahrang in a theih tikah a ninghang in a hnipuan a thlek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puithiam Hilkiah, Shafan ih fapa Ahikam, Mikaiah ih fapa Akbor, sungṭuan Shafan le siangpahrang bawmtu Asaiah pawl a ko ih an hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Feh uhla hi cabu-ih zirhmi thu-ah keimah le Judah mi pawl ai-awh in Bawipa va ron hnik uh. Kan parah Bawipa a thin a heng; ziangahtile hi cabu ih tuah ding, a timi cu kan pupa pawl in an thlun lo a si; kanmah thuhla ah hi cabu sungih nganmi vek in an thlun lo,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah puithiam Hilkiah, Shafan, Ahikam, Akbor le Asaiah pawl cu Jerusalem vengthar ih a ummi profet nu Huldah tong dingah an feh. (A pasal Shallum, Tikvah ih fapa le Harhas ih tupa, cu Biakinn korfualpi pawl kiltu a si.) An thuhla cu an sim ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huldah cun an hnenah, “Siangpahrang hnenah va kir uhla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa ih ṭong cu hiti in a si, va sim uh: ‘Siangpahrang ih a siar zomi cabu sungih a um bangin Jerusalem le khawsung mi pawl ka hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keimah in hnong ih khawzing dangdang hnenah thawinak an pek; an milem tuahmi hmuahhmuah in ka thin in hengter. Ka thinhengnak cu mei-sa bangin a alh ih zianghman in a toihdai thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siangpahrang amah parah cun Bawipa keimah Israel ih Pathian in hiti in ka sim: Cabu sungih nganmi cu na thei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem le a khawsungmi pawl hmuahhmuah ka hrem ding, ti na theih tikah siir aw in na hnipuan na thlek ih ṭap phah in ka hmaiah na thinlung a neem ruangah na thlacamnak ka lo theihsak a si. Jerusalem le a khawsungmi pawl ka hremzia mi tampi in an hmuh tikah tuksumza an ti ding ih a hmun cu midang camnak ih hmanmi hminah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain Jerusalem ka hremnak ding tikcu tiang cu na nung lo ding; hnangamnak thawn na nunnak cu ka cemter ding,’ a ti va ti uh,” tiah a ti. Cuih thu thawn annih cu Siangpahrang Josiah hnenah cun an kir.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Josiah in Judah ram le Jerusalem khua ih hotu pawl a ko ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />cupawl thawn Bawipa ih Biakinn ahcun a feh. Puithiam le profet pawl, Jerusalem khawsung mi zatein, milian siseh mifarah siseh an thlun ṭheh. An zate ih hmaiah Biakinn sungih an hmuhmi Thukamnak cabu cu ringzet in a siar ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siangpahrang dinnak hrangih tuahmi ṭhuam kiang ahcun Josiah cu a ding ih cuih cabu sungih a um vekin Bawipa ih thu ngai dingah, a thinlung le a nunnak zatein a daan le a thupekmi hmuahhmuah thlun dingah le thukam sungih a ummi vekih tuah ṭheh dingah Bawipa ih hnenah thukam a tuah. Misenpi khal in Bawipa ih pekmi thukam cu thlun ding in thu an kam ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Josiah in Baal khawzing biaknak ih hmanmi thilri hmuahhmuah, khawzingnu Asherah biaknak le arsi pawl biaknak ih hman mi thilri hmuahhmuah cu Bawipa ih Biakinn ihsin suah thluh dingah Puithiam Sang Hilkiah, a bawmtu puithiam pawl le Biakinn sangka ih ṭuanvo neitu pawl hnenah thu a pek. A thupek vekin an suah thluh ih cuih thilri pawl cu siangpahrang in Jerusalem khawpi leng, Kidron Horkuam kiangah a ur ṭheh ih a vutcam pawl cu Bethel ah a kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hlanih Judah siangpahrang a ṭuantu siangpahrang pawl ih hnaṭuan pekmi puithiam pawl, Jerusalem kiangkap le Judah ram sungah khawzing biakṭheng parih thawinak petu puithiam pawl le Baal khawzing, ni, thla, arsi le van ih a ummi hmuahhmuah hnenih thawinak petu puithiam pawl hmuahhmuah cu an hnaṭuan in a dawi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa ih Biakinn ih Asherah khawzingnu hrangah phunmi ṭhuam thianghlim cu a phawi in Jerusalem khawleng, Kidron Horkuam ah a ur ih dip tein a deen ṭheh hnuah misenpi phumnak thlaanmual ah a theh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa Biakinn thawn peh-aw in an sakmi hlawhhlang pawl ih umnak inn pawl cu a bal ṭheh. (Cutawk ahcun nunau pawl in khawzingnu Asherah biaknak ah puan an tah a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah ram sung khawpi pawl ihsin puithiam pawl cu Jerusalem ah a khawm ṭheh ih an raithawinak biakṭheng cu ramsung khuazakip ah, Geba ihsin Beersheba tiang, a borhhlawhter ṭheh. Khawpi luhnak kotka kehlam ih a ummi, khawpi uktu bawi Joshua ih sakmi kotka kiangih me-khawsia hrang tiin sakmi, biakṭheng pawl tla a balsiat ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih puithiam pawl cu Bawipa ih Biakinn sungah hnaṭuantu an si thei lo; asinain an rualpi puithiam pawl hrangih pekmi thilnu tel lo sang cu an ei thei ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Josiah in Molek khawzing hnenih an fanu le an fapa mei-ur raithawinak in an pek thei nawn lonak dingah Hinnom Horkuam ih an khawzing biaknak hmun Tofeth cu a borhhlawhter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang pawl ih an rak tuahmi, ni biaknak le upatnak ah an timi rang pawl cu a siatsuah ih rangleng pawl khal a ur ṭheh. (Hi rang le rangleng pawl cu Bawipa ih Biakinn hmuan sung kotka kiang, Nathan Melek timi bawi upa inn ihsin naite ah an retmi a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang pawl in siangpahrang inn diphun parih an rak donmi biakṭheng pawl le Bawipa ih Biakinn ih khaan pahnih sungih siangpahrang Manasseh in biakṭheng a donmi pawl cu siangpahrang Josiah in a bal ṭheh; biakṭheng pawl cu dip seksek in a deen ih Kidron Horkuam ah a hlon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Olif Tlang ihsin thlanglam, Jerusalem in nisuahnak ih siangpahrang Solomon in ningsinza khawzing pawl, Sidon mi khawzingnu Astartes, Moab mi khawzing Khemosh le Ammon mi khawzing Milkom hrangih a donmi biakṭheng pawl cu a borhhlawhter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih khawzing pawl hrangih lungphun pawl cu a khuai ṭheh ih khawzingnu Asherah hrangih an ṭhuam phunmi pawl a hau ṭheh ih an rak dinnak hmun pawl cu milai ruh in a khuh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nebat fapa, Israel mi pawl sualnak sungih a hruailuttu, siangpahrang Jeroboam in Bethel ah khawzing biaknak a sakmi cu Josiah in a balsiat ṭheh. Biakṭheng tla a bal hnuah lungphun pawl a khuai ṭheh ih dip ko in a deng thluh. Asherah biaknak hrangih an ṭhuam thianghlim tla a ur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun Josiah in a kiangkap a hun zoh ih tlang parah thlaan pawl a hmu. A sungih ruh pawl cu a phorhter hai ih biakṭheng parah a ur. Cuticun biakṭheng cu a borhhlawhter ih, hlanlaipi ih puai caanah cuih biakṭheng kiangih siangpahrang Jeroboam a rak din laiah profet in a rak sim ciami cu a kimter. Siangpahrang Josiah cun a kiangkap a hun zohsal ih cuih thu a rak simtu profet ih thlan cu a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Zo ih thlaan so a si?” tiah a sut. Bethel khuami pawl in, “Judah ihsin ra tahratin hih biakṭheng parih na tuahmi thil pawl hi a cang leh ding a si, tiih a rak simtu profet thlaan a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Josiah in, “Hi thlaan cu zohman in dai hlah uh; hiti te in umseh. A ruh pawl khal nan phorh lo pei,” tiah thu a pek. Curuangah a ruh pawl cu an phorh lo. Samaria in a rami profet pawl ih ruh khal an phorh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Israel siangpahrang pawl ih an rak tuahmi, Bawipa ih thin a hengtertu biakṭheng pawl cu Israel ramah tampi an um. Cuih khawvel biakṭheng pawl cu Israel khawpi tinah an um ih Josiah in a bal ṭheh. Bethel khua biakṭheng parih a tuah vekin hi biakṭheng pawl ih par khalah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih khawvel biakṭheng ih hnaṭuantu puithiam pawl cu an hnaṭuannak biakṭheng parah cun a that ṭheh. Cule biakṭheng tinih parah milai ruh a ur. Cuih hnuah Jerusalem ah a kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Siangpahrang Josiah cun Thukam cabu sungih a um bangtuk in Bawipa an Pathian upatnak ah Lantak Puai tuah dingin misenpi hnenah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuṭhentu pawl in Israel ram pumpi an uk thok ihsin Israel siangpahrang pawl in siseh, Judah siangpahrang pawl khal in siseh, siangpahrang zohman in tuihṭum ih Lantak Puai an tuah vek cun an tuah dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A netnak ah Josiah in siangpahrang a ṭuan kum hleiriatnak ah Lantak Puai cu Jerusalem ah an tuah suak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Puithiam Sang Hilkiah in Bawipa ih Biakinn sungih a hmuhmi cabu sungih a ummi daan pawl cu thlunsuak tengteng ding in Jerusalem khua le Judah ram sungih a ummi pol pawl le kutṭial zohthiam pawl cu siangpahrang Josiah in a dawi ṭheh; innsang milem pawl, khawzing lem pawl le an khawzing biaknak thilri hmuahhmuah tla a siatbal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siangpahrang Josiah bangtuk ih Bawipa ih hnaṭuan, a thinlung zate, a fimnak zate le a thazaang zate in a ṭuan ih Moses Daan a thlun thluhtu siangpahrang an um dah lo; amah ih hnu khalah amah vek cu an um dah hrih lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa ih thinhengnak cu siangpahrang Manasseh ih thiltuah mi ruangah Judah mi parah mei bangin a sa ih atu khalah a dai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel parih ka thiltuah mi bangin Judah par khalah ka tuah ding: Ka mithmuh lonak ramah Judah mi cu ka dawihlo hai ding; ka hrilcia mi Jerusalem khawpi le keimah in biak ringringnak dingah ka timi Biakinn cu ka hnong ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siangpahrang Josiah ih hnaṭuanmi dangdang cu Judah Siangpahrang Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Josiah cu Judah siangpahrang a si laiah Izipt siangpahrang Neko in a ralkap pawl a ho ih Assiria siangpahrang bawm dingah Eufrates Tiva lamah a feh. Cumi cu siangpahrang Josiah in kham a tum; Megiddo ah Izipt siangpahrang thawn an do-aw ih Josiah cu an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A kuthnuai bawi pawl in a ruak cu rangleng in Jerusalem ah an phur ih siangpahrang thlaan ah an phum. Cule Judah mi pawl in Josiah ih fapa Jehoahaz cu a pa ai-awhtu dingah an hril ih hriak an culh ih siangpahrang ah an canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehoahaz cu kum kul hluanthum a ti ah Judah siangpahrang a cang ih Jerusalem ihsin thla thum sung a uk. A nu cu Libnah khuami Jeremiah ih fanu Hamutal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jehoahaz cun khuahlan a pupa pawl ih ziaza a thlun ruangah Bawipa ih mithmuh ah a sual.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Izipt siangpahrang Neko in a kai ih Hamath ram, Riblah khua ah thawngah a thlak; cule Judah mi pawl in Izipt siangpahrang hnenah ngun tangkafai in cuai thawnghnih le sui cuai kul siah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Siangpahrang Neko in Josiah ih fapa Eliakim cu Josiah ai-awhtu ah Judah siangpahrang ah a tuah ih a hmin cu Jehoiakim ah a thleng. Jehoahaz cu siangpahrang Neko in Izipt ramah a hruai ih cutawkah a thita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cun Siangpahrang Jehoiakim cun Izipt siangpahrang ih siah dil mi tlin dingah misenpi hnen in an len le an farah zoh in, ngunkhuai a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehoiakim cu kum kul hluannga a ti ah Judah siangpahrang a cang ih Jerusalem in kum hleikhat sung a uk. A nu cu Rumah khuami Pedaiah ih fanu Zebidah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jehoiakim in a pupa pawl ih ziaza a thlun ruangah Bawipa ih mithmuh ah a sual.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoiakim Judah siangpahrang a si laiah Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in Judah ram cu a do ih kum thum sung Nebuchadnezzar kuthnuai ah a um. Cuih hnuah ral a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in Babilon mi, Siria mi, Moab mi le Ammon mi pawl cu Jehoiakim do dingah le Judah ram siatsuah dingah a thlah. Himi cu Bawipa in a hnaṭuantu profet pawl hnen in a rak sim ciami a kimternak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siangpahrang Manasseh sualnak hmuahhmuah ruangah le, a bik in, sualnak nei lomi pawl ih thisen tamtuk a luanter ruangah Bawipa in Judah mi pawl cu a mithmuh lonak ramih dawihlo ṭheh a tum ruangah hi thil pawl cu Amah ih thupeknak in a cangmi an si. Bawipa in Manasseh cu a ngaithiam thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoiakim ih hnaṭuanmi dangdang cu Judah Siangpahrang Thuanthu Cabu sungah an ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jehoiakim cu a thi ih a fapa Jehoiakhin in a ai-ah siangpahrang a run ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Izipt siangpahrang le a ralkap pawl cu an ram ihsin ram dangah voikhat hman an fehsal thei nawn lo; ziangahtile Izipt ih rak ukmi ram tampi Babilon siangpahrang in a lak ṭheh ih Eufrates Tiva ihsin Izipt Tiva tiang a uk ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiakhin cu kum hleiriat a ti ah Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan ih Jerusalem ihsin thla thum sung a uk. A nu cu Jerusalem khuami Elnathan ih fanu Nehusta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoiakhin cu a pa ih ziaza a thlun ruangah Bawipa ih parah a sual a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jehoiakhin Judah siangpahrang a si laiah Babilon ralkap pawl Nebuchadnezzar ih ralbawi pawl ho in Judah ram ah an rung ih Jerusalem khawpi an kulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An kulh sungah cun Nebuchadnezzar amah rori Jerusalem ah a ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />siangpahrang Jehoiakhin cun a nu, amah a riantu hnen-um pawl, a kuthnuai bawi pawl le siangpahrang ralkap hotu bawi pawl thawn Nebuchadnezzar hnenah a feh ih a kuthnuai ah a lut. Nebuchadnezzar in Babilon ram a uknak kum riat kumah Jehoiakhin cu a kaih ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa ih Biakinn le siangpahrang inn ih a ummi sui le ngun pawl cu Babilon ah a phur ṭheh. Bawipa ih a rak sim cia vekin Nebuchadnezzar in Bawipa ih Biakinn ih hman dingah Solomon in sui ih a tuahmi thilri pawl a khuai ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem khawsungmi, siangpahrang sungkhat le hotu pawl hmuahhmuah, an zate in thawnghra, Babilon ah Nebuchadnezzar in salah a hruai. Zungthiam pawl le sodeng pawl tiangin a hruai ṭheh ih Judah ramah cun mifarah bik pawl lawng a taan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Nebuchadnezzar in siangpahrang Jehoiakhin cu a nu le a nupi pawl, a kuthnuai bawi pawl le Judah ram hotu pawl thawn Babilon ah salah a hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Micak le mi thupi pawl, ralkap ṭuan theitu le raldo dingah a tiar-aw cia pawl thawng sarih, le zungthiam pawl le sodeng pawl minung thawng khat, Babilon ah a hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in Jehoiakhin ih paseu, Mattaniah cu Judah siangpahrang ah a tuah ih a hmin cu Zedekiah ah a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zedekiah cu kum kul hluan khat a ti ah Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan ih Jerusalem ihsin kum hleikhat a uk. A nu cu Libnah khuami Jeremiah ih fanu Hamutal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siangpahrang Jehoiakim ih sualnak tuahmi cu siangpahrang Zedekiah khal in a tuah ih Bawipa ih parah misual a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jerusalem le Judah mi parah Bawipa cu a thin a heng ngaingai ih a mithmuh lonak ramah a dawihlo hai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar cu a kuthnuai ih ummi Judah siangpahrang Zedekiah in a do. Curuangah Nebuchadnezzar cu a ralkap pawl thawn a ra ih Zedekiah in Judah ram a uk kum kua-nak, thla hra-nak ih ni hra ni ah Jerusalem cu a do. Jerusalem khua an kulh ih a leng kimvel in phardawl lan theinak ah leilung an khahsilh ih cutiin ṭanhmun an khuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuticun Zedekiah in ram a uk kum hleikhatnak tiang an kulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule cuih kum, thla linak ih ni kua ni ah, khawsung mi pawl cu zianghman ei ding an neih nawn lo tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />khawpi kulhnak hruang cu an bauh ih Babilon ralkap pawl cun an kil ṭhepṭhep naón zanah Zedekiah le a ralkap pawl cu an suak thluh. Siangpahrang hmuan ih lamzin zawh in phar pahnih karlak kot in an suak ih Jordan Phairawn lamah an tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain Babilon ralkap pawl in siangpahrang Zedekiah cu an duum ih Jerikho khua kiangih hmunrawn ah an man ih an kai; a ralkap pawl cun an tlansan thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zedekiah cu Babilon ralkap pawl in an hruai ih Riblah khua ih siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar a rak um laiah a hnenah an thlenpi. Cutawkah Nebuchadnezzar in a thu a ṭhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zedekiah mithmuh hngan rori ah a fapa pahnih cu an that; cule Zedekiah ih mit cu a pahnih in an phorh ih dar cikcin in an khih hnuah Babilon khua ah an hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in Babilon ram a uk kum hleikuanak, thla nganak ih ni sarih ni ah siangpahrang ralkap pawl hotu le siangpahrang ruahnak petu a si mi Nebuzaradan cu Jerusalem khawsung ah a lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa ih Biakinn, siangpahrang inn le Jerusalem ih bawi le upa deuhdeuh pawl ih inn pawl a ur ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule a ralkap pawl in khawpi ralhruang cu an bal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun Nebuzaradan in Jerusalem ih a taangmi senpi pawl, zungthiam pawl le Babilon mi hnenih a rak ṭangtu pawl cu Babilon ah a hruai ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah ram sungih a taantami pawl cu thilri zianghman a nei lomi farah bik pawl an si ih cupawl cu sabit hmuan le lo sungah hna a ṭuanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babilon ralkap pawl cun Bawipa ih Biakinn sungih a ummi dar ih tuahmi ṭhuam pawl le ṭhuam dinnak pawl cu an khiak an khuai ṭheh. Dar ih tuahmi tidai retnak maihum tumpi cu an khuai ṭheh ih dar pawl cu Babilon ah an phur ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cawhleek pawl, biakṭheng ih vutcam lawhnak kheng pawl, mei-inn kilkhawinak ih hmanmi thilri pawl, thawinak ih pekmi ṭilva ih thisen donnak maihum pawl le rimhmui urnak kheng pawl le Biakinn sungih hmanmi dar ih tuahmi thilri dangdang pawl tla an lak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih tlunah sui le ngun ih tuahmi thilri hmuahhmuah, maihum fatete pawl le meivam kennak kheng pawl tla an lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa ih Biakinn hrangih Solomon in dar ih a tuahmi ṭhuam pahnih, ṭhuam dinnak pawl le tidai retnak maihum tumpi pawl cu an tum zetzet ih a cuai khai thei ding pawl an si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ṭhuam pahnih cu an tia-aw ih pi kul hluan sarih an sang ih ṭhuam pakhat ih lubo cu pi li le a hrek a sang. Cuih ṭhuam lubo kimvel cu dar in an tuah ih taleti zuk cuangin an mawiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun ralkap hotu ralbawipa Nebuzaradan cun Puithiam Sang Seraiah, a sangtu puithiam Zefaniah le a dang Biakinn upa bikbik pathum pawl a kai ih a hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih tlunah khawpi sungih ralkap hotu ralbawipa, siangpahrang ruahnak petu panga, ralkap lamih cazin kaitu, ralkap hotu bawipa bawmtu le a dangdang mi upa sawmruk pawl tla a kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cupawl cu Babilon siangpahrang, Hammath ram Riblah khua ih a um laiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nebuzaradan in a fehpi ih siangpahrang ih thupek vekin cutawkah an hrem ih an that ṭheh. Cuticun Judah mi pawl cu an ram ihsin an thawng tlaknak ramah an hruai hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in Ahikam fapa, Shafan ih tupa, Gedaliah cu Babilon ramih thawng thlak lomi, Judah ramih a taangmi pawl hotu ah Judah ram uktu bawi ah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cumi cu siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar kuthnuai ih a lut lomi Judah ralbawi pawl le ralkap pawl in an theih tikah Gedaliah hnenah Mizpah khua ah an ra. Cuih ralbawi pawl cu Nethaniah fapa Ishmael, Kareah fapa Johanan, Netofah khuami Tanhumeth ih fapa Seraiah le Maakath mi Jezaniah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule Gedaliah in anmah le an ralkap pawl hnenah cun, “Thungai in ka lo sim: Babilon bawi pawl ṭih ding zianghman a um lo. Judah ramah hin um uhla Babilon siangpahrang hna cu ṭuan uh. Cuticun ziang hmuahhmuah a rem ko ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Asinain cuih kum, thla sarih thla ah Nethaniah fapa, Elishama ih tupa, Judah siangpahrang ih sungkhat a si mi Ishmael cu ralkap pahra thawn Mizpah ah an feh ih Gedaliah cu an that. Gedaliah hnenih a ummi Israel mi le Babilon mi pawl tla an that ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule Israel misenpi pawl cu a lian siseh a farah siseh, ralbawi pawl thawn Babilon mi an ṭih ruangah an suak ih Izipt ramah an tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Evilmerodak cu Babilon ram siangpahrang a cang ih a can kum rori ah Judah siangpahrang Jehoiakhin cu a zaangfah ih thawng ihsin a suah. A suah ni cu Jehoiakhin thawng a tlaknak kum sawmthum le kum sarihnak, thla hleihnih thla ih ni kul hluan sarih ni ah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Evilmerodak in Jehoiakhin cu ṭhazet in a zoh ih amah thawn Babilon ramih thawng an thlakmi siangpahrang dangdang hnakin upatnak a pek cuang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jehoiakhin cu a thawngtla hnipuan a thlengter ṭheh ih a nunsung hmuahhmuah ah Babilon siangpahrang thawn rawl an ei tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A dam sung cu nitinte in a ṭulmi leinak ah paisa tla a pek ringring.
  </para>
</usx>
